desc_buf_ng_jh_hjxf_0=Flower Mental Skill<br>Each critical will remove 8% of the targets base Energy. 8 second cool down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_hjxf_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Flower Mental Skill</font><br>Each critical hit removes 8% of the target's Max Energy. 8 seconds cool down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_hjxf_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Flower Mental Skill</font><br>Each critical hit removes 11% of the target's Max Energy. 8 seconds cool down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_hjxf_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Flower Mental Skill</font><br>Each critical hit removes 11% of the target's Max Energy and decrease their External Attack Damage by 7% (Effect is active for 20 seconds and can be stacked up to 3 time). 8 second cool down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_hjxf_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Flower Mental Skill</font><br>Each critical hit removes 15% of the target's Max Energy, and decrease their Internal and External Attack Damage by 12% (Effect is active for 20 seconds and can be stacked up to 3 time). 8 second cool down.
