desc_buf_ng_wd_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill</font><br/>When attacked there is a 10% chance to activate Chi and absorb 100 points of damage received. When the Chi times out or is dispelled, some of your Energy will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill</font><br/>When attacked there is a 10% chance to activate Chi and absorb 150 points of damage received. When the Chi times out or is dispelled, some of your Energy will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill</font><br/>When attacked there is a 10% chance to activate Chi and absorb 210 points of damage received. When the Chi times out or is dispelled, some of your Energy will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill</font><br/>When attacked there is a 10% chance to activate Chi and absorb 250 points of damage received. When the Chi times out or is dispelled, some of your Energy will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Inner Focus Skill</font><br/>When Energy drops below 40%, each attack has a 12% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is above 40%, each attack deals additional damage equals to 2% of current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Inner Focus Skill</font><br/>When Energy drops below 40%, each attack has a 16% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is above 40%, each attack deals additional damage equals to 3% of current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Inner Focus Skill</font><br/>When Energy drops below 40%, each attack has a 20% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is above 40%, each attack deals additional damage equals to 4% of current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Inner Focus Skill</font><br/>Each attack has a 20% chance to recover 2% Energy and deals additional damage equals to 4% of current Energy.
