desc_buf_ng_wd_003_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Sea</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: When attacked by enemy while HP is below 30%, recovers 30% of Max HP in 6 seconds. 200 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless Sea</font>: Increases the jumping speed of Whirlwind Step by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Sea</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: When attacked by enemy while HP is below 30%, recovers 30% of Max HP in 6 seconds. 150 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless Sea</font>: Increases the jumping speed of Whirlwind Step by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Sea</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: When attacked by enemy while HP is below 30%, recovers 30% of Max HP in 5 seconds. 120 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless Sea</font>: Increases the jumping speed of Whirlwind Step by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Sea</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: When attacked by enemy while HP is below 30%, recovers 30% of Max HP in 5 seconds. 100 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless Sea</font>: Increases the jumping speed of Whirlwind Step by 3.
