desc_buf_ng_jz_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Passing Wisdom Skill</font><br/>Each attack has a 40% chance to recover Energy. Recovered amount will increase based on the Breath points.
desc_buf_ng_jz_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Passing Wisdom Skill</font><br/>Each attack has a 40% chance to recover Energy. Recovered amount will increase based on the Breath points and sometimes the recovery will be continuous.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Secrets of Dual Training</font><br/>After 6 attacks, the next attack deals additional 200% Weapon Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Secrets of Dual Training</font><br/>After 5 attacks, the next attack deals additional 200% Weapon Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Secrets of Dual Training</font><br/>After 4 attacks, the next attack deals additional 200% Weapon Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Secrets of Dual Training</font><br/>After 4 attacks, the next attack deals additional 300% Weapon Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret to Happiness</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the next 3 will recover your HP (The recovered HP value is 30% of damage dealt)<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Complete Team Cultivation while "The Secret to Happiness" is activated and you will recover an additional 2 Flying Skill points every second. Active for 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_1=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret to Happiness</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the next 3 will recover your HP (The recovered HP value is 30% of damage dealt)<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Complete Team Cultivation while "The Secret to Happiness" is activated and you will recover an additional 2 Flying Skill points every second. Active for 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_2=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret to Happiness</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the next 3 will recover your HP (The recovered HP value is 40% of damage dealt)<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Complete Team Cultivation while "The Secret to Happiness" is activated and you will recover an additional 2 Flying Skill points every second. Active for 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_3=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret to Happiness</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the next 4 will recover your HP (The recovered HP value is 40% of damage dealt)<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Complete Team Cultivation while "The Secret to Happiness" is activated and you will recover an additional 2 Flying Skill points every second. Active for 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_4=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret to Happiness</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the next 4 will recover your HP (The recovered HP value is 50% of damage dealt)<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Complete Team Cultivation while "The Secret to Happiness" is activated and you will recover an additional 2 Flying Skill points every second. Active for 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Seven Limitations Manual</font><br/>After using 8 skills, the next attack will recover 5% Max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Seven Limitations Manual</font><br/>After using 7 skills, the next attack will recover 5% Max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Seven Limitations Manual</font><br/>After using 6 skills, the next attack will recover 5% Max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Seven Limitations Manual</font><br/>After using 5 skills, the next attack will recover 5% Max Energy and repel the target.
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Directions Manual</font><br/>Increases Critical Damage by 20%
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Directions Manual</font><br/>Increases Critical Damage by 35%
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Directions Manual</font><br/>Increases Critical Damage by 50%
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Directions Manual</font><br/>Increases Critical Damage by 60%, and deals additional damage when landing critical hits for 8 seconds. Effect can be stacked and the additional damage increases with increase in Dexterity.
buf_ng_tm_003=The Secret of Venom
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_1=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Venom</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack will have a chance to stack poison. Once the poison is stacked 3 times, the next attack will inflict it upon the target - Dealing 18 Yin damage every second for a limited time; Once the effect is over, the poison will break out, dealing 144 Yin damage, decrease Speed by 50% and lock Flying Skills. <font color="#00FF00">(The damage will increase along with Ranged Damage)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance of immunity from the poison effect.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_2=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Venom</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack will have a chance to stack poison. Once the poison is stacked 3 times, the next attack will inflict it upon the target - Dealing 25 Yin damage every second for a limited time; Once the effect is over, the poison will break out, dealing 200 Yin damage, decrease Speed by 50% and lock Flying Skills. <font color="#00FF00">(The damage will increase along with Ranged Damage)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance of immunity from the poison effect.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_3=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Venom</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack will have a chance to stack poison. Once the poison is stacked 3 times, the next attack will inflict it upon the target - Dealing 31 Yin damage every second for a limited time; Once the effect is over, the poison will break out, dealing 248 Yin damage, decrease Speed by 50% and lock Flying Skills. <font color="#00FF00">(The damage will increase along with Ranged Damage)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance of immunity from the poison effect.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_4=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Venom</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack will have a chance to stack poison. Once the poison is stacked 3 times, the next attack will inflict it upon the target - Dealing 39 Yin damage every second for a limited time; Once the effect is over, the poison will break out, dealing 312 Yin damage, decrease Speed by 50% and lock Flying Skills. <font color="#00FF00">(The damage will increase along with Ranged Damage)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance of immunity from the poison effect.
