buf_ng_jh_208=Evil Against-Heaven Skill
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When the attack is not parried, it obtains <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi, and each level of Evil Chi boosts the attack by 1. 5%. Damage will last for 16 seconds and can be stacked 8 times. However, once the attack is parried and the Chi becomes relaxed, you will lose a layer of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> When <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi is relaxed, it may stimulate its own potential and boost defense by 50% for a certain period of time. All attacks will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage, lasting for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When the attack is not parried, it obtains <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi, and each level of Chi boosts the attack by 1. 5% Damage will last for 16 seconds and can be stacked 9 times. However, once the attack is parried and the Chi becomes relaxed, you will lose a layer of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> When <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi is relaxed, it may stimulate its own potential and boost defense by 50% within a certain period of time. All attacks will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage lasting for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When the attack is not parried, it obtains <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi, and each level of Chi boosts the attack by 1. 5%. Damage will last for 16 seconds and can be stacked 10 times. However, once the attack is parried and the Chi becomes relaxed, you will lose a layer of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> When <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi is relaxed, it may stimulate its own potential and boost defense by 50% within a certain period of time. All attacks will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When the attack is not parried, it obtains <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi, and each level of Chi boosts the attack by 1. 5%. Damage will last for 16 seconds and can be stacked 11 times. However, once the attack is parried and the Chi becomes relaxed, you will lose a layer of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> When <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi is relaxed, it may stimulate its own potential and boost defense by 50% within a certain period of time. All attacks will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage lasting for 11 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When the attack is not parried, it obtains <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi, and each level of Chi boosts the attack by 1. 5%. Damage will last for 16 seconds and can be stacked 13 times. However, once the attack is parried and the Chi relaxed, you will lose a layer of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> When <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font>Chi is relaxed, it may stimulate its own potential and boost defense by 50% within a certain period of time. All attacks will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage lasting for 12 seconds.
