buf_CS_jh_hyjf06_01=Face the Wind and Ignore the Snow
desc_buf_CS_jh_hyjf06_01_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_hyjf06_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Facing Snow</font><br/>The using process of [Sudden Snow is Changeable], [Windy and Snowy] and [Snow Falling without Trace] becomes Enhanced Endurance (Each time it is used, the player will consume 1 layer of "Facing Snow" status). The rage which is needed by [Hating Snow] is decreased (Each level of "Facing Snow" status will decrease 1 point of rage consumption. Each attack will consume 1 layer of "Facing Snow" status).
desc_buf_CS_jh_hyjf06_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Facing Snow</font><br/>The using process of [Sudden Snow is Changeable], [Windy and Snowy] and [Snow Falling without Trace] becomes Enhanced Endurance (Each time it is used, the player will consume 1 layer of "Facing Snow" status). The rage which is needed by [Hating Snow] is decreased (Each level of "Facing Snow" status will decrease 1 point of rage consumption. Each attack will consume 1 layer of "Facing Snow" status).
