buf_devote_1=The Daily School Contribution Reward is BUFF.
desc_buf_devote_1_0=Daily School Contribution Reward. The rate of Experience Conversion will be increased by 50%.
buf_CS_jh_hyjf08_03=Strong Enhanced Endurance (Red)
desc_buf_CS_jh_hyjf08_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_hyjf08_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Strong Enhanced Endurance (Red)</font><br/>
buf_ng_npc_em_001="Emei Stilt Walking" Skill
desc_buf_ng_npc_em_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">"Emei Stilt Walking" Skill</font><br/>Reduce an extra 90% internal skill damage and 70% external skill damage while blocking.
buf_ng_npc_em_002=Five Talisman Manual
desc_buf_ng_npc_em_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Talisman Manual</font><br/>Activate Chi and absorb 260 damage every 20 seconds while reflecting damage received when Chi is active.
buf_ng_npc_em_003=Flying String Feather Script
desc_buf_ng_npc_em_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Flying Feather Manual</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Comfort Meridians</font>: Each attack can restore HP by 2% within 5 seconds, and a chance to restore double HP.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Take A Breath in Air</font>: Can take a breath in air after using Jump Across the Cloud. Can be used continuously within 3 seconds.
buf_ng_npc_gb_002=Divine Skill of the Yuyang
desc_buf_ng_npc_gb_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of the Yuyang</font><br/>Attacks drain Chi. When stacked 5 times, the next attack will shock the target with Chi. Damage dealt is based on your Brawn value.
buf_ng_npc_gb_003=Subdue Inner Dragons
desc_buf_ng_npc_gb_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Subdue Inner Dragons</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Dragon Roar</font>: Attacks have a chance to deal Yang damage based on 10% of your <font color="#FF3030">current</font> HP (458 base) <br/><font color="#FF3030">Recover</font>: Recover 7 Flying Skill points every second during "Sit and Breathe" and remove Drunk effects.
buf_ng_npc_jl_001=Secrets of Dual Training
desc_buf_ng_npc_jl_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Secrets of Dual Training</font><br/>After 4 attacks, the following attack's damage will be 3x the value of the weapon's damage.
buf_ng_npc_jl_003=The Secret to Happiness
desc_buf_ng_npc_jl_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Joined Happiness Secret</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After six attacks, the following four attacks will recover your HP (the value of recovered HP is equal to 50% of damage dealt or a chance to recover 100% of damage dealt). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Joined Happiness Secret lets you recover two flying skill points per second, lasting 60 minutes.
buf_ng_npc_jy_001=Xuanyuan Manual
desc_buf_ng_npc_jy_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Xuanyuan Manual</font><br/>Deal continuous damage to target and decrease their HP Recovery Speed by 100%. Active for 20 seconds.
buf_ng_npc_jy_003=The Seven Executions
desc_buf_ng_npc_jy_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">The Seven Executions</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Deadly Strike</font>: Each attack has a chance to stack 1 piece of Killing Will: Increases Brawn by 18. When stacked 7 times, External damage dealt with be increased by the value of your Brawn, and will deal an additional 8% damage based on the value of HP lost to a target whose HP is lower than 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Centaur</font>: Increase Sprint duration by 100%.
buf_ng_npc_jz_001=Passing Wisdom Skill
desc_buf_ng_npc_jz_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Passing Wisdom Skill</font><br/>Each attack has a 40% chance to recover Energy. Recovered amount will increase based on your Breath points. Chance to grant continuous recovery.
buf_ng_npc_sl_001=Meditation
desc_buf_ng_npc_sl_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Meditation</font><br/>15% chance for each attack to recover HP.
buf_ng_npc_sl_001_01=Meditation
desc_buf_ng_npc_sl_001_01_0=<s>
buf_ng_npc_sl_002=Two Fingers of Zen Meditation
desc_buf_ng_npc_sl_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Two Fingers of Zen Meditation</font><br/>Each attack will shock surrounding targets. Damage will increase based on Brawn.
buf_ng_npc_sl_002_01=Two Fingers of Zen Meditation
desc_buf_ng_npc_sl_002_01_0=<s>
buf_ng_npc_tm_001=Seven Limitations Manual
desc_buf_ng_npc_tm_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Seven Limitation Manual</font><br/>After using 5 skills, the next attack will recover the base Energy by 5%.
buf_ng_npc_tm_002=Six Directions Manual
desc_buf_ng_npc_tm_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Directions Manual</font><br/>Increase Critical Damage by 60%. A Critical Hit will also increase your Dexterity. Active for 8 seconds and can be stacked.
buf_ng_npc_tm_003=Five Poison Script
desc_buf_ng_npc_tm_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Poison Script</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack will have a chance to store poison in both hands, and when stacked three times, can be injected into enemy's body by the next attack: Deals 39 yin damage per second, plus another 312 yin damage, reduced 50% speed, and the target cannot use flying skills <font color="#00FF00">(damage increases with range). </font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance to be immune to the poison effect.
buf_ng_npc_wd_001=Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill
desc_buf_ng_npc_wd_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Yang Heart Protecting Skill</font><br/>When attacked there is a 10% chance to activate Chi and absorb 250 points of damage received. When the Chi times out or is dispelled, some of your Energy will be recovered and surrounding enemies will be stunned.
buf_ng_npc_wd_002=Inner Focus Skill
desc_buf_ng_npc_wd_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Inner Focus Skill</font><br/>Attacks have a 20% chance to recover Energy by 2% and add additional damage based on 4% of your current Energy.
buf_ng_npc_wd_003=Boundless Sea
desc_buf_ng_npc_wd_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Sea</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: When attacked while HP is below 30%, base HP will recover by 30% within 5 seconds. 100 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless Sea</font>: Increase launch Speed of Whirlwind Step by 3.
