desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Flaunting Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> buff: The skill <font color="#FFAE00">[Feigned Defeat]</font> range increases by 3 meters, <font color="#FFAE00">[Admitted Defeat]</font> range increase by 8 meters, ranges for other skills of the set increase by 2 meters.
