buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2=Withdrawn Move
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 6 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of of 11 points; Increase the distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 8 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 15 points; Increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 9 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 19 points; increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 11 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 22 points; increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 14 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 27 points; increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font><br>Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 16 points for each hit from <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 32 points; increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
