buf_CS_jh_qbgf06=Turning Tables
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 50% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 1 second.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 60% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 1 second.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 70% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 1.5 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 80% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 1.5 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 90% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf06_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Turning Tables</font><br>The next time you take a hit, 99% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 2 seconds.
