buf_ng_jh_306_db1=Disorder
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_db1_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_db1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Disorder</font><br/>The Chi inside the body becomes muddled periodically. A deep pain will be felt. It is more easily triggered when gathering Chi or using flying skills. <br/><font color="#CFB53B">A dull pain in the chest. </font><br/><font color="#CC3299">Maybe the Five Terrors of the Labyrinth know how to deactivate it. </font>
