buf_ng_jh_108=Chaotic Yuan
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds and a set chance to disable all negative effects. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
