buf_ng_jh_209=Ice Heart Code
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart</font><br/>Parries have a fixed chance of triggering Icy Heart defense: parry can recover HP for 4 seconds (Recovery amount is 170% of damage received. Max. base recovery amount is 50 points and influenced by internal skill strength. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart</font><br/>Parries have a fixed chance of triggering Icy Heart defense: parry can recover HP under 5 seconds (Recovery amount is 190% of damage received. Max. base recovery amount is 100 points and influenced by internal skill strength. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart</font><br/>Parries have a fixed chance of triggering Icy Heart defense: parry can recover HP for 6 seconds (Recovery amount is 210% of damage received. Max. base recovery amount is 170 points and influenced by internal skill strength. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart</font><br/>Parries have a fixed chance of triggering Icy Heart defense: parry can recover HP for 7 seconds (Recovery amount is 230% of damage received. Max. base recovery amount is 236 points and influenced by internal skill strength. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
