desc_buf_4nei_emei03_range_0=Sending a fresh breeze
desc_buf_4nei_emei03_range_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb001_0=You are healing and temporarily cannot move. You will unleash a vast amount of Vile Chi against nearby enemies every 5 seconds.
desc_buf_4nei_gb001_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb002_0=Affected by Vile Chi, lasts until damage, and reduces movement speed. The Vile Chi effect can accumulate and reach a maximum of 20 levels.
desc_buf_4nei_gb002_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb003_0=Bi Jiahuo is healing his wounds, and his formidable Internal Skill generates Energy Body Protection. He can absorb a huge amount of damage, and ordinary people cannot defeat him, and the Chi he radiates can strengthen his followers.
desc_buf_4nei_gb003_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb004_0=This follower's piety won Bi Jiahuo's protection. Being close to Bi Jiahuo gives him Energy Body Protection, which greatly increases his own power.
desc_buf_4nei_gb004_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb005_0=Receiving his Energy Body Protection, the follower is burning his life force and briefly strengthening himself.
desc_buf_4nei_gb005_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb006_0=This follower has already thoroughly burned up his own life, so his attacking force is increased 200% and his movement speed is increased 100%.
desc_buf_4nei_gb006_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gb007_0=Followers receiving Bi Jiahuo's Energy Body Protection have Chi from the same source. Absorbing this Chi from the same source will greatly increase your attacking power, and you will temporarily be able to damage him without being affected by his Body Protecting Chi.
desc_buf_4nei_gb007_1=Followers receiving Bi Jiahuo's Energy Body Protection have chi from the same source. Absorbing this chi from the same source will greatly increase your attacking power, and you will temporarily be able to Damage him without being affected by his Body Protecting Chi.
desc_buf_4nei_gbj001_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gbj001_CD_0=You temporarily cannot obtain the Lightweight I effect, and cannot use any Flying Skill or other skills.
desc_buf_4nei_gbj001_CD_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gbj002_1=
desc_buf_4nei_gbj002_CD_0=You temporarily cannot obtain the Lightweight II effect, and cannot use any Flying Skill or other skills.
