desc_buf_CS_jh_zq08_0=Drunken surge step, making a toast while bending the waist: Increases the power of skills in this set by X%, where X is your alcohol tolerance. Greatly increases evasion. Movement speed slows down. The effect can be canceled the next time this skill is used. You must have 3 levels of drunken effect before getting Dead Drunk. Using it again can convert this effect to level 3 of "Caihe Waist Strike."
desc_buf_CS_jh_zq08_01_0=Drunken surge step, making a toast while bending the waist.
desc_buf_CS_jh_zq08_01_1=Drunken surge step with bent waist and offering wine.
desc_buf_CS_jh_zq08_1=Drunken surge step with bent waist and offering wine: Increases the power of this routine's skill by X%, greatly increases evasion. Movement speed slows down. (The state can be canceled the next time this is used. You must have attained 3 levels of Drunken Mind before getting Dead Drunk. X is added to your alcohol tolerance.) Using it again can transform this state to level 3 "Caihe Embrace" state.
