desc_buf_ng_em_004_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_em_004_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Assault </font><br/>Causes temporary fainting
desc_buf_ng_em_004_cd2_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_em_004_cd2_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_em_004_cd_2=<s>
desc_buf_ng_em_004_cd_3=<s>
desc_buf_ng_em_004_cd_4=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Drunk</font><br/>You gain one stack of "Wine God" every 4 seconds, lasting for 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine Rain </font><br/>When soaked with <font color="#FF3030">Wine Rain</font>, internal and external defense decreases by 50%, evasion rate decreases by 30%, rate of being hit by Critical Hit increases by 18%, with the effect lasting for 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_03_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Sobering Up </font><br/>Critical Hit rate increases 10%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_04_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_04_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine God</font>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of Raining Wine </font><br/>When the attack starts, there is a probability of causing a "Wine Rain". The targets soaked by Wine Rain have their inner and outer defenses and evasion severely decreased and their probability of being hit by Critical Hit raised by 18% for 30 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a skill, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd2_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd2_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd2_2=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd2_3=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd2_4=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd_2=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd_3=<s>
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_cd_4=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Recovery</font><br/>Continuous recovery of HP, and a set chance to disable all negative effects.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_02_6=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds and a set chance to disable all negative effects. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Toad Poison</font><br/>Continuously affected by poison. Continuous outflow of HP. When level 8 has been reached, it will trigger explosion of poison, break through current move and trigger paralyzation for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Evil</font><br/>Attack Damage will be increased by 1. 5% in each level.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_02_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>Defense will be increased tremendously, and the attack will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil </font><br/>When your attack is not parried, you will receive an <font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence</font>. Each level of Evil Influence will increase attack damage by 1.5%. It lasts 16 seconds, and can stack up to 15 times. If your attack is later parried, your Chi will be dispersed, and you will lose a level of <font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence</font>. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven: Your </font><font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence </font>will disperse, but you may be able to increase your defensive ability by 50% for a period of time, and add large amounts of Soft damage to your attacks for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart defense</font><br/>Parry restores large amount of HP (Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Manual </font><br/>Has a probability of triggering the Icy Heart Defense effect: parry has a probability of triggering the Icy Heart Defense effect: parry within 9 seconds can restore HP The amount of recovery is 250% of attack damage suffered, and basic maximum recovery is 388 points, subject to Internal attack damage. It can be triggered up to a maximum of once per 0.5 seconds), and your Parry Endurance recovery will increase greatly when protecting yourself.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade</font><br/>Continuous loss of blood. All recovery effects lowered by 80%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_cd_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_cd_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will decrease Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 1.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_02_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will increase Breath by 3.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill </font><br/>You can reduce your opponent's Spirit, Breath, and Stamina by one point each when attacking, and convert them to your own Breath, lasts 30 seconds. There is 50% probability of stacking one additional time during each attack, to a maximum of 35 times
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Attacking effect </font><br/>12% of internal and external defense are ignored, and inner and external attack damage are increased by 6%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg02_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Defensive effect </font><br/>All damage received is reduced by 24%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Hidden Prowess </font><br/>The damage you receive will decrease by 24%. You will lose immunity from injury during attacks, but can ignore your target's 12% Internal and External Defense damage reduction, and you also gain 6% damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_01_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Accumulate Chi</font><br/>Gathering Chi.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_02_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Endure</font><br/>Cannot be locked, knocked back, repelled, or knocked down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunset Skill </font><br/>Concentrates Chi to protect you when attacking or when you're attacked, and you enter the Super Armor effect for 3 seconds. Being attacked triggers a 30% chance that the target's skill will be interrupted while protection is in effect.. Gather Chi again for 14 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Monster's Image</font><br/>Critical Hit Rate increases by 30%.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Monster's Image</font><br/>Critical Hit has a chance to increases by 30%
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Demeanor </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 25% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">All Appearances are Demonic </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 25% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Demeanor </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 30% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Demeanor </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 35% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Demeanor </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 40% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_03_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Demeanor </font><br/>Absorb HP equal to 50% of attack damage.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image </font><br/>When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 4 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 50% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 30%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Murderous Pursuit</font>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Murderous Pursuit </font><br/>An additional 28 points of target's external parry and internal skill defense are ignored, and a large amount of hard damage is added (parry is ignored).
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Sky Flips the Scale </font><br/>damage received reduced by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Sky Flips the Scale </font><br/>damage received reduced by 12%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Sky Flips the Scale </font><br/>damage received reduced by 14%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Sky Flips the Scale </font><br/>damage received reduced by 16%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_03_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Sky Flips the Scale </font><br/>damage received reduced by 18%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_2=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_3=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_4=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_cd1_5=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Chi of Flying Flowers </font><br/>Continuously receives soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Chi Swells</font><br/>Attacks will trigger internal injury and receive additional Yang Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_03_5=<s>
desc_buf_ng_npc_jh_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Self Recollection Skill</font><br/>Chance to negate 40 damage and an additional 30% damage.
desc_buf_ng_npc_jh_001_1=
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_01_5=Decrease damage received
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Sandalwood Fragrance </font><br/>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_cd2_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_cd2_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_specially_tetanic_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font>
desc_buf_ng_specially_tetanic_1=
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison </font><br/>A strange poison causes continuous HP loss.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison Outbreak </font><br/>Movement speed is reduced to the minimum and then gradually recovers in 4 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison Outbreak </font><br/>Movement speed is reduced to the minimum and then gradually recovers in 4 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison Outbreak </font><br/>Movement speed is reduced to the minimum and then gradually recovers in 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison Outbreak </font><br/>Movement speed is reduced to the minimum and then gradually recovers in 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Yin Poison Outbreak </font><br/>Movement speed is reduced to the minimum and then gradually recovers in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skills</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skills</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skills</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skills</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_03_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skills</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Shock</font><br/>When being attacked, you will have extra Yang Damage. Making an additional move after 3 moves will give you additional internal injury. Interrupt current moves and seal for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_03_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Aggravate Internal Injury</font><br/>Unable to use skills for a short period of time.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Pure Yang Wuji Skill </font><br/>‎There is a probability that your target will receive a "concussion" effect, suffering additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasting 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer "Aggravated Internal Injury" if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 3 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
