desc_buff_4nei_xs_001_0=The chill on Snowy Mountain Summit is bone-piercing. Because of poor Internal Skill, you cannot prevent the cold from entering your heart, and your movement speed will be reduced by 30%, Attacking Power reduced by 30%, and each Internal Force blow softened
desc_buff_4nei_xs_001_1=
desc_buff_4nei_xs_002_0=The chill on Snowy Mountain Summit is bone-piercing. Internal Skill can only block some of the cold, but causes uneven Breathing, and movement speed will be reduced by 25%, Attacking Power reduced by 25%, and each Internal Force blow softened.
desc_buff_4nei_xs_002_1=
desc_buff_4nei_xs_003_0=The chill on Snowy Mountain Summit is bone-piercing. Use Internal Skill to protect your Meridians if you want to prevent Chi from flowing away, but your circulation will be impeded, movement speed will be reduced by 20%, Attacking Power reduced by 20%, and each Internal Force blow softened.
desc_buff_4nei_xs_003_1=
desc_buff_4nei_xs_004_0=The chill on Snowy Mountain Summit is bone-piercing. You can preserve your power only by using advanced Internal Skill to protect your body, but your movements will be sluggish, your movement speed reduced by 15%, Attacking Power reduced by 15%, and each Internal Force blow softened.
desc_buff_4nei_xs_004_1=
