desc_buf_ng_em_004_0=There's a chance to activate "Ice Jade Binding" effect when hit: Removes most debuffs, recovers some Parry Endurance, adds Yin damage to each attack for 10 seconds and decreases damage received when parrying.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Drunk</font><br/>Gain the Wine God state every 4 seconds for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Drunk</font><br/>Gain the Wine God state every 4 seconds for 25 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_01_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Drunk</font><br/>Gain the Wine God state every 4 seconds for 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Drunk</font><br/>Gain the Wine God state every 4 seconds for 35 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine Rain</font><br/>If you are touched with <font color="#FF3030">"Wine Rain," </font>your Internal and External defense will be decreased by 30%, Dodge Rate decreased by 10% and chance of taking a Critical Hit increased by 10%. These effects last 18 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_02_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine Rain</font><br/>Touched with <font color="#FF3030">"Wine Rain," </font>your Internal and External defense will be decreased by 35%, Dodge Rate decreased by 15% and chance of taking Critical Hit increased by 12%. These effects last 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_02_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine Rain</font><br/>Touched with <font color="#FF3030">"Wine Rain," </font>your Internal and External defense will be decreased by 40%, Dodge Rate decreased by 20% and chance of taking Critical Hit increased by 14%. These effects last 22 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_02_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Wine Rain</font><br/>Touched with <font color="#FF3030">"Wine Rain," </font>your Internal and External defense will be decreased by 45%, Dodge Rate decreased by 25% and chance of taking Critical Hit increased by 16%. These effects last 25 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Sobering Up</font><br/>Critical Hit Rate increases by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_03_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Sobering Up</font><br/>Critical Hit Rate increases by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_03_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Sobering Up</font><br/>Critical Hit Rate increases by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_03_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Sobering Up</font><br/>Critical Hit Rate increases by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of Raining Wine</font><br/>When starting the attack, you have a chance to trigger Wine Rain. Affected targets' Internal and External defense Dodge Rate will decrease and Critical Hit vulnerability will increase by 10%.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you acquire Drunken effect which keeps giving you Drunken God effect. Using an ability consumes one stack of Drunken God effect, the rest Drunken God effect would grant bonus Yang damage when attacking. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>When Drunken God exists, attacks may trigger Sobering Up effect, increasing critical hit chance by 10% for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of Raining Wine</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to trigger Wine Rain. Affected targets' Internal and External defense and dodge rate are greatly reduced, and critical hit vulnerability is also increased by 12%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you acquire Drunken effect which continuously applies the Drunken God effect. Using an ability consumes one stack of Drunken God effect, the rest Drunken God effect would grant bonus Yang damage when attacking. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>When Drunken God exists, attacks may trigger Sobering Up effect, increasing critical hit chance by 10% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of Raining Wine</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to trigger Wine Rain, targets attached with Wine Rain will have their Internal and External defense as well as dodge rate greatly reduced, and their chance of taking critical hit is also increased by 14%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you acquire Drunken effect which keeps giving you Drunken God effect. Using an ability consumes one stack of Drunken God effect, the rest Drunken God effect would grant bonus Yang damage when attacking. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>When Drunken God exists, attacks may trigger Sobering Up effect, increasing critical hit chance by 10% for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of Raining Wine</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to trigger Wine Rain, targets attached with Wine Rain will have their Internal and External defense as well as dodge rate greatly reduced, and their chance of taking critical hit is also increased by 16%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you acquire Drunken effect which keeps giving you Drunken God effect. Using an ability consumes one stack of Drunken God effect, the rest Drunken God effect would grant bonus Yang damage when attacking. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>When Drunken God exists, attacks may trigger Sobering Up effect, increasing critical hit chance by 10% for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart</font><br/>Parries have a fixed chance of triggering Icy Heart defense: parry can recover HP for 8 seconds (Recovery amount is 250% of damage received. Max. base recovery amount is 298 points and influenced by internal skill strength. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 18% while the Demonic Image buff is active.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 21% while the Demonic Image buff is active.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_01_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 24% while the Demonic Image buff is active..
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 27% while the Demonic Image buff is active.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 18%.
