desc_buf_ng_jl_004_02_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 27%.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Has a chance to enter Demonic status while attacking, gaining buff Demonic Demeanor and the 3rd level of Demonic Image. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>gain HP for a duration of 12 sec. from 25% of the damage dealt by your own critical hit. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Image: </font>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 18% and decrease Demonic Image by one level for every critical hit dealt on target for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Has a chance to enter Monster status while attacking, gaining buff Demonic Demeanor and the 3rd level of Demonic Image. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>gain HP for a duration of 12 sec. from 30% of the damage dealt by your own critical hit. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Image: </font>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 21% and decrease Demonic Image by one level for every critical hit dealt on target for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Has a chance to enter Monster status while attacking, gaining buff Demonic Demeanor and the 3rd level of Demonic Image. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>gain HP for a duration of 12 sec. from 35% of the damage dealt by your own critical hit. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Image: </font>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 24% and decrease Demonic Image by one level for every critical hit dealt on target for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Demonic Image</font><br/>Has a chance to enter Monster status while attacking, gaining buff: Demonic Demeanor and the 3rd level of Demonic Image. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>gain HP for a duration of 12 sec. from 40% of the damage dealt by your own critical hit. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Image: </font>Increases Critical Hit Rate by 27% and decrease Demonic Image by one level for every critical hit dealt on target  for 15 seconds.
