desc_buf_ng_wd_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Pure Yang Wuji Skill</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to shock the enemy. This gives the enemy extra Yang Damage for each attack; this effect lasts 11 seconds.<br/> <font color="#9932CD">Pure Yang Without-Limits:</font> If the enemy has more than three moves after injury, Bonus Internal Damage will be triggered. The current release moves will be interrupted and he will be Skill Sealed for 2 seconds.<br/>If Bonus Internal Damage is not triggered, attach it to the enemy after Shock ends.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Pure Yang Wuji Skill</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to shock the enemy. This gives the enemy extra Yang Damage for each attack; this effect lasts 12 seconds.<br/> <font color="#9932CD">Pure Yang Without-Limits:</font> If the enemy has more than three moves after injury, Bonus Internal Damage will be triggered. The current release moves will be interrupted and he will be Skill Sealed for 2 seconds.<br/>If Bonus Internal Damage is not triggered, attach it to the enemy after Shock ends.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Pure Yang Wuji Skill</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to shock the enemy. This gives the enemy extra Yang Damage for each attack; this effect lasts 13 seconds.<br/> <font color="#9932CD">Pure Yang Without-Limits:</font> If the enemy has more than three moves after injury, Bonus Internal Damage will be triggered. The current release moves will be interrupted and he will be Skill Sealed for 2 seconds.<br/>If Bonus Internal Damage is not triggered, attach it to the enemy after Shock ends.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Pure Yang Wuji Skill</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to shock the enemy. This gives the enemy extra Yang Damage for each attack; this effect lasts 14 seconds.<br/> <font color="#9932CD">Pure Yang Without-Limits:</font> If the enemy has more than three moves after injury, Bonus Internal Damage will be triggered. The current release moves will be interrupted and he will be Skill Sealed for 2 seconds.<br/>If Bonus Internal Damage is not triggered, attach it to the enemy after Shock ends.
