desc_Buff_storm_bt01_0=Blown flying by the Tornado because of weak Immunity (Blown flying and carried into the sky because Immunity not strong enough to resist the violent Tornado)
desc_Buff_storm_bt01_1=
desc_Buff_storm_buff01_0=In the Desert Raid for Treasure Instance, the player recovers 5 Flying Skill Points every second but the recovery process stops when the player enters combat mode. If the player disengages from the combat, the recovery process will resume.
desc_Buff_storm_buff01_1=
desc_Buff_storm_buff02_0=The player recovers 5 Flying Skill Points every second but the recovery process stops when the player enters combat mode
