desc_Buff_storm_buff12_1=
desc_Buff_storm_buff21_0=In Desert Raid for Treasure Instance, the player acquires 2 seconds of Immunity against being blown away by a weak tornado every 10 seconds (the immunity does not protect the player against a violent tornado)
