desc_buf_Npc_bt_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Super Armor</font><br/>Cannot be knocked back or knocked down. Skill cannot be disabled.
desc_buf_Npc_bt_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Super Armor</font><br/>Cannot be knocked back or fell by a blow. Cannot be locked on by a skill.
desc_buf_Npc_bxj_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Manual</font><br/>parry has chance of triggering the Icy Heart Defense effect: parrying within the next 9 seconds restores HP (amount recovered is 250% of damage received; basic maximum recovery amount is 388 points; recovery amount is based on internal attack damage; can only be triggered once every 0.5 seconds) and dramatically increases parry endurance recovery speed.
desc_buf_Npc_bxj_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Manual </font><br/>Has a certain probability of triggering the Icy Heart Self-protection effect: Parry has a certain probability of triggering the Icy Heart Self-protection effect: Parry within 9 seconds can restore HP (the amount of recovery is 250% of Attack Damage suffered, and basic maximum recovery is 388 points, subject to Internal Attack Damage; can be triggered up to a maximum of once per 0.5 seconds), and your Parry Endurance recovery speed will increase extraordinarily when protecting yourself.
desc_buf_Npc_hyg_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Huanyuan Style</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds and a set chance to disable all negative effects. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_Npc_hyg_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Huanyuan Style</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds and a set chance to disable all negative effects. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
