desc_buf_ng_jxnpc_em_003_1=
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_0=<br>Golden Lock: <br>When being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 5 seconds, player will recover 6% of maximum HP and 3% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 4% of maximum HP and 3% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 4.5% of maximum HP and 3.2% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 5% of maximum HP and 3.4% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 5.5% of maximum HP and 3.6% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 6% of maximum HP and 4% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br> when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 6.2% of maximum HP and 4.2% of maximum energy
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Golden Lock</font><br> when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 6 seconds, player will recover 6.5% of maximum HP and 4.5% of maximum energy
