desc_buf_ng_wg_001_f_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Toad Armor</font><br/>When on the verge of death, receiving another blow activates Ice Toad Armor. This effect dramatically increases player's internal and external defense. Player also has continuous recovery of HP (based on level of player's internal attack damage) and immunity to all negative effects and debuffs. After a while. The pet goes into "Sleep" mode and cannot be triggered for a certain period of time.
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_f_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Toad Armor</font><br/>When on the verge of death, receiving another blow activates Ice Toad Armor. This effect dramatically increases player's internal and external defense. Player also has continuous recovery of HP (based on level of player's internal attack damage) and immunity from all negative effects and debuffs. After a while, the treasure goes into "Sleep" mode and cannot be triggered for a certain period of time.
