desc_buf_nmp_sj003_0=Meridian Yin Yang Needle - With the primary needle in use, circulation is irregular and you feel indisposed. It is difficult to get rid of. This effect will be cleared in the next scene of the main storyline. If you already betrayed Golden Needle Sect and are still suffering from this needle, go to Shen Jun at 268,830 to remove this effect.
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_1=Meridian Yin Yang Needle-main needle, circulation is irregular and you feel indisposed. It is difficult to get rid of.  (this effect will be cleared in the next scene of the main storyline) (if you already betrayed Golden Needle Sect and are still suffering from this needle, go to Shen Jun at 268,830 to remove this effect)
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_1_0=Meridian Yin Yang Needle - With the secondary needle in use, causes stagnation in internal energy. Stamina is decreased by 5 points and brawn is increased by 3 points. This effect can be cured through medicine.
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_1_1=Meridian Yin Yang Needle-sub needle, causes stagnation in internal energy. Stamina is decreased by 5 points and brawn is increased by 3 points. This effect can be cured through medicine.
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_2_0=Under the influence of Meridian Yin Yang Needle - secondary needle, energy has decreased.
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_2_1=
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_3_0=Detoxifying
desc_buf_nmp_sj003_3_1=
desc_buf_nmp_sj004_0=Taking this Heart Protection Pill will dramatically increase your resistance to poisons. You should taste unknown herbs while the pill is in effect.
desc_buf_nmp_sj004_1=
desc_buf_nmp_sj005_0=Tasting unknown herbs.
desc_buf_nmp_sj005_1=
desc_buf_nmp_sj007_0=You no longer have the Heart Protection Pill effect, the herb's poison circulates wildly in your body.
desc_buf_nmp_sj007_1=
desc_buf_nmp_sj008_0=Meridian Yin Yang Needle-main needle, circulation is irregular. This is difficult to get rid of.  You have been struck by a needle and fallen under the control of Shen Xiyu and Shen Peijue.
