desc_buf_yaopin_jzsj_002_0=You are in a stable state of mind and can control your desire to kill. This cancels out the Rage effect from the King Snake. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Needle Sect Secret Medicine</font><br>While taking the medicine, your Yin defense and softness defense increase by 145 points. This medicine can be taken with other medications, but only one Golden Needle Sect Secret Medicine effect can exist on a player at one time.
desc_buf_yaopin_jzsj_002_1=
desc_buf_yaopin_jzsj_003_0=You are full of energy and restless. This negates the roar of the Green-Eyed Tiger King. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Needle Sect Secret Medicine</font><br>While taking the medication, your Yang defense and hard defense are increased by 145 points. This medicine can be taken with other medications, but only one Golden Needle Sect Secret Medicine effect can exist on a player at one time
desc_buf_yhg_ddnx01_1=
desc_buf_yhg_ddnx02_0=the effects of the miasma are strengthening, and you are beginning to lose control of your body.
desc_buf_yhg_ddnx02_1=
