desc_buff_xjzgh_01_0=<s>
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_1=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 1 stackable effect: recover 10 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 20%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 0.5% and internal and external critical hit damage is increased by 3%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_2=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 2 stacked effects: recover 15 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 25%, internal and external critical hit is increased by 1% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 4%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_3=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 3 stacked effects: recover 20 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 30%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 1.5% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 5%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_4=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 4 stacked effects: recover 25 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 35%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 2% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 6%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_5=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 5 effect: recover 30 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 40%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 2.5% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 7%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_6=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 6 effect: recover 35 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 45%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 3% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 8%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_01_7=Food cooked at the campfire is all the more delicious. You feel comfortable and relaxed, and your stats increase (level 7 effect: recover 40 points energy every 5 seconds, parry endurance is increased by 50%, internal and external critical hit are increased by 3.5% and internal and external critical hit damage are increased by 9%).
desc_buff_xjzgh_02_0=You can rest here near the fire.
desc_buff_xjzgh_02_1=As you drew near to the fire, you feel warmth spread through your body. You can rest here a while.
desc_buff_xjzgh_02_2=As you drew near to the fire, you feel warmth spread through your body. You can rest here a while.
desc_buff_xjzgh_02_3=As you drew near to the fire, you feel warmth spread through your body. You can rest here a while.
