desc_buf_item_restrain_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Metal Element Flag</font><br/>Increases healing effect by 10%;<br/>If attacked by <font color="#FFAE00">Wild Shot Fist II</font> while <font color="#FFAE00">Hundred Transformations</font> is active on the attacker, applies Metal Element Flag–Silence to the attacker, preventing the attacker from casting <font color="#FFAE00">Wild Shot Fist II</font>. Lasts 2 minutes. This effect can stack.
desc_buf_item_restrain_01_1_0=<s>
