desc_buf_ng_jh_108_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Recovery</font><br/>Continuous recovery of HP, and a set chance to disable all negative effects.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_02_7=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Yuan</font><br/>If attacked while flying skills are prohibited, paralyzed or fainted, continuous recovery of HP for 3 seconds and a set chance to disable all negative effects. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Toad Poison</font><br/>Continuously affected by poison. Continuous outflow of HP. When level 8 has been reached, it will trigger explosion of poison, break through current move and trigger Paralysis for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Evil</font><br/>Attack Damage will be increased by 1. 5% in each level.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_02_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>Defense will be increased tremendously, and the attack will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>Applies a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Chi to yourself each time your attack is not parried, increasing damage done by 1.5% for 20 seconds. Stacks up to 15 times. Inflicts Chi Dispersion on yourself each time your attack is parried, removing a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Chi.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven:</font> there’s a chance that your potential will be realized while <font color="#FF3030"> Chi</font> disperses, increasing Defense by 60% and making all attacks deal a large amount of additional Softness damage. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart defense</font><br/>Parry restores large amount of HP (Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Manual</font><br/>Parry has a chance to apply Ice Heart Defense to yourself, healing the amount of health equal to 2.5 times as much as the damage taken for 10 seconds (the base amount cannot be greater than 869, actual amount to heal is decided by your Internal Attack Damage). This effect cannot occur more than once every 0.5 second. In the duration of Icy Heart Defense, your Parry Endurance restoration speed will increase sharply
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade</font><br/>Continuous loss of blood. All recovery effects lowered by 80%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will decrease Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 1.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_02_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will increase Breath by 3.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Inflicts loss of 1 Spirit, 1 Breath and 1 Stamina on the target while attacking. Turns the loss into your own Breath. Lasts 30 seconds. Each attack has an 80% chance to apply an additional stack of this effect. Stacks up to 45 times.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Attack State</font><br/>Ignores 14% Internal and External Defense. Increases 8% Internal and External Attack Damage
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg02_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Defensive effect </font><br/>All damage received is reduced by 24%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Hidden Prowess</font><br/>Reduces all damage taken by 24%. Nullifies your Damage Reduction while attacking. Ignores 14% of the target’s Internal and External Defense and increases your damage done by 8%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_01_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Accumulate Chi</font><br/>Gathering Chi.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_02_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Weaken Enhanced Endurance Status (Yellow)</font><br/>Unable to be locked, blown away, repelled and knocked down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunset Skill</font><br/>Gathers Chi to protect yourself while you cast a skill and while you are attacked. Grants Super Armor for a duration of 4 seconds. While Super Armor is applied on your being hit, there is a 30% chance that the target’s skill will be interrupted. It takes 14 seconds to gather Chi the second time around.
