desc_buff_bossadv009003_ng_0=If Lu Lixian is not in the "Seamless" state, you can create a Chi of Three Purities Defense to hide in the cabin when attacking him.
desc_buff_bossadv009003_ng_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009003_ngcd_0=Lu Lixian’s attack with Seamless continues incessantly for 20 seconds, leaving no opportunity for you to create a Chi of Three Purities Defense.
desc_buff_bossadv009003_ngcd_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009004_01a_0=Coming with blazing flames.
desc_buff_bossadv009004_01a_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009004_01b_0=Causes damage to nearby players
desc_buff_bossadv009004_01b_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009004_02_0=The excessive Yang Energy generates flames at your feet .
desc_buff_bossadv009004_02_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009004_ng01_0=Don’t stand in one place for too long.
desc_buff_bossadv009004_ng01_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009004_ng_0=When fighting, if you do not move for a prolonged time, your excessive Yang Energy will generate flames at your feet.
desc_buff_bossadv009004_ng_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng01_0=This skill is available in 2 forms: <br>People who are not in the air when attacked by the first form of this skill will continuously lose HP and their Meridian will be damaged because of the Impact of the Five Sacred Mountains. <br>People who are in the air when attacked by the second form of this skill will continuously lose HP because of the Reversal Impact of the Five Sacred Mountains.
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng01_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng02_0=Cause damage to people on the ground. This skill's form will alternate every 1 minute.
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng02_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng03_0=Cause damage to people jumping up in the air. This skill's form will alternate every 1 minute.
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng03_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng04_0=Continuously restores Flying Skill
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng04_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng05_0=Adds limitless Flying Skill buff to self
desc_buff_bossadv009005_ng05_1=
