desc_buff_bossadv009005_wj01_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009005_wj01a_0=this skill protects you from the Impact of the Five Sacred Mountains
desc_buff_bossadv009005_wj01a_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009006_01a_0=When attacked by Calamities of Heaven and Earth, you will lose the control of your body and can get out of the calamity only with the assistance of others.
desc_buff_bossadv009006_01a_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009006_01b_0=Break the calamity’s eye to obtain the method to escape from the calamity.
desc_buff_bossadv009006_01b_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng01_0=Release of Energy: the attack with this skill will inflict Internal Injury on people in the vicinity. <br>When sustaining an Internal Injury at Levels 0–19, you can stop the use of skills and heal yourself slowly. <br>When sustaining an Internal Injury at Levels 20–29, you will get hurt in spite of your attempt to heal yourself. <br>If you try to use Skill by force after sustaining an Internal Injury at Level 30 or above, you will die instantly.
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng01_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng02_0=You will also sustain Internal Injury every time you use this skill
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng02_1=
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng03_0=Such Internal Injury can be healed by abstaining from the use of skills and by healing yourself slowly
desc_buff_bossadv009006_ng03_1=
