desc_buff_shitu_fuli_0=<s>
desc_buff_shitu_fuli_1=The encouragement of the Elder Disciple (Sister) gives rise to a surge of power in the lower stomach area of mine. It makes me feel that I am brimming with power. It adds 2000 points to max HP, 1000 points to max Energy, 25 points to HP Recovery, 15 points to Energy Recovery, and 25 points to Brawn, Breath, Spirit, Dexterity, and Stamina, respectively)
desc_buff_shitu_fuli_2=The encouragement of the Elder Disciple (Sister) gives rise to a surge of power in the lower stomach area of mine. It makes me feel that I am brimming with power. It adds 2500 points to max HP, 1500 points to max Energy, 35 points to HP Recovery, 25 points to Energy Recovery, 50 points to Brawn, Breath, Spirit, Dexterity, and Stamina, respectively, and increases the Critical Hit Probabilities of internal and External skills by 3%)
desc_buff_shitu_fuli_3=The encouragement of the Elder Disciple (Sister) gives rise to a surge of power in the lower stomach area of mine. It makes me feel that I am brimming with power. It adds 3000 points to max HP, 2000 points to max Energy, 45 points to HP Recovery, 35 points to Energy Recovery, 75 points to Brawn, Breath, Spirit, Dexterity, and Stamina, respectively, and increases the Critical Hit Probabilities of internal and External skills by 5%)
desc_buff_shitu_fuli_4=The encouragement of the Elder Disciple (Sister) gives rise to a surge of power in the lower stomach area of mine. It makes me feel that I am brimming with power. It adds 3500 points to max HP, 2500 points to max Energy, 55 points to HP Recovery, 45 points to Energy Recovery, 100 points to Brawn, Breath, Spirit, Dexterity, and Stamina, respectively, and increases the Critical Hit Probabilities of internal and External skills by 5% and the Critical Hit Damage of internal and External skills by 10%)
desc_buff_shitushili_001_0=Vigorous Brawn Pill, a legendary Sedative exclusively owned by Expert Herbalists that enhances the power of Tier 2 internal skills, is capable of adding 30 points to all attributes, 1000 points to max HP, and 500 points to max Energy.
