desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_1=Aspiration<br>The more times an enemy is hit, the more damage the enemy will take. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_1_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_1_1=Thunderous Aspiration<br>grants "Thunderous" on a successful parry. Grants Aspiration when Thunderous stacks up to 5 times. Aspiration: The more times an enemy is hit, the more damage the enemy will take. (not counting skills from other skill sets)
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_2_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_2_1=Thunderous<br>Lasts 30 seconds. Grants Aspiration when Thunderous stacks up to 5 times.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_3_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE02_3_1=Who's More Powerful<br>Each stacks grants 20 bonus damage, can stack up to 20 times.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE03_1_0=Swallow Wind<br>Arm meridian is injured, when it stacks up to 3 times, will be affected by Swallow Wind Blows Hard effect: parry won't function in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE03_1_1=Swallow Wind<br>Arm meridian is injured, when it stacks up to 3 times, will be affected by Swallow Wind Blows Hard status effect: Parry won't function in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE03_2_0=Swallow Wind Blows Hard<br>Meridian is injured and the two arms become feeble, so that parry won't function in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE03_2_1=Swallow Wind Blows Hard<br>Meridian is injured and the two arms become feeble, so that Parry won't function in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE05_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE05_1=Keyboard Shortcuts Confusion<br>Directional key strokes are randomized.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE05_1_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE05_1_1=Disable Flying skills<br>Disables Flying skills, lasts 6 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_1_0=Haven't Returned Since Last Departure <br>Deducts 10% of the target's Maximum HP, then restores 1% HP for the target every second for 20 seconds, cannot occur more than once for the same target in 20 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_1_1=Haven't Returned Since Last Departure <br>Deducts 10% of the target's Maximum HP, then restores 0.5% HP for the target every second for 20 seconds, cannot occur more than once for the same target in 20 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_2_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_2_1=Flummoxed<br>Being clumsy and failed in three times of quick key-pressing - HP restoration speed brought by the skill Haven't Returned Since Last Departure has halved
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_2_1_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_2_1_1=Clumsy Strategy <br> pressed the wrong key in the quick key-pressing
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_3_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE06_3_1=Haven't Returned Since Last Departure (Tragic) <br> that's tragic enough, stop deducting my HP.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE07_1_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE07_1_1=Double Down<br>Enters into Quick Time Event mode, so that each key-pressing failure will bring "Scared" effect (Scared: increases enemy's critical hit rating by 20%, lasts 10 seconds)
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE07_2_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE07_2_1=Scared<br>more likely for the enemy to do critical hit damage to you, lasts 10 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_01_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_01_1=Dagger Revealed<br>When there are 3 stacks of such effect, character will be immobile and affected by Quick Time Event mode, failure of removal will invite Blood Vessel Burst
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_02_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_02_1=Quick Time Event Immobile<br>Immobile, enters into Quick Time Event mode, failure of removal will invite severe punishment.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_03_1=Quick Time Event<br>Successful key-pressing can remove Immobile, failure of key-pressing will invite extra punishment.
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_04_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_jh_QTE08_04_1=Blood Vessel Burst<br>Failed to be rid of the Quick Time Event mode, Meridian Reversal occurred, and Blood Vessel Burst occurred
