desc_buf_CS_jh_zq08_10=Drunken surge step with bent waist and offering wine: Increases the power of this routine's skill by X%, greatly increases evasion. Movement speed slows down. (The state can be canceled the next time this is used. You must have attained 3 levels of Drunken Mind before getting Dead Drunk. X is added to your alcohol tolerance.) Using it again can transform this state to level 3 "Caihe Embrace" state.
