desc_buf_ng_em_005_03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Weakened</font><br>Movement damage reduced by 30%.
desc_buf_ng_em_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Great Nirvana</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, you can gain a shield. The shield absorbs damage, deals Yang Damage continuously to the surrounding enemies and reduces the target's internal skill defense, lasting 6 seconds.  <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect disappears. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Great Nirvana</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, you can gain a shield. The shield absorbs damage, deals Yang Damage continuously to the surrounding enemies and reduces the target's internal skill defense, lasting 7 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect disappears. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Great Nirvana</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, you can gain a shield. The shield absorbs damage, deals Yang Damage continuously to the surrounding enemies and reduces the target's internal skill defense, lasting 8 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect disappears. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Great Nirvana</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, you can gain a shield. The shield absorbs damage, deals Yang Damage continuously to the surrounding enemies and reduces the target's internal skill defense, lasting 9 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect disappears. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Great Nirvana</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, you can gain a shield. The shield absorbs damage, deals Yang Damage continuously to the surrounding enemies and reduces the target's internal skill defense, lasting 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">No matter how the shield disappears, it will deal an explosive damage that can reduce the affected targets' Attach by 30%, lasting 10 seconds.  </font>
