desc_buf_ng_jl_005_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font><br>When attacking the enemy in the state of Bloodshed in the Wind, it absorbs the enemy's HP continuously (It can be triggered every 0.5 second at most).
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_02_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font><br>When attacking the enemy in the state of Bloodshed in the Wind, it absorbs the enemy's HP continuously (It can be triggered every 0.5 second at most).
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_02_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font><br>When attacking the enemy in the state of Bloodshed in the Wind, it absorbs the enemy's HP continuously (It can be triggered every 0.5 second at most).
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_02_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font><br>When attacking the enemy in the state of Bloodshed in the Wind, it absorbs the enemy's HP continuously (It can be triggered every 0.5 second at most).
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font><br>When attacking the enemy in the state of Bloodshed in the Wind, it absorbs the enemy's HP continuously (It can be triggered every 0.5 second at most), and increase critical hit rate by 6% during the period.
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Patting Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 6 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Patting Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 7 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Patting Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Patting Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 9 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Patting Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.) It can also increase own critical hit rate by 6% for some time.
