desc_buf_ng_th_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Blue Waves Mental skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>The water rages and the white wave crests resemble mountains. When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 60% damage + 603 points softness damage, and decreasing the target's speed by 40% and banning the target from using flying skills in the next 3 seconds, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: Turbulent undercurrents and hidden and dangerous. When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 4 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
