desc_buf_ng_tm_005_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font><br>Each time the player uses movement, they will lose HP. The greater the Toxin stack is, the more HP they will lose.
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font><br>Each time the player uses movement, they will lose HP. The greater the Toxin stack is, the more HP they will lose. <br>Each stack reduces an additional 3% movement damage.
