desc_buf_ng_ws_001_1_cd_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Breathing</font><br>Circulate chi and recover for 20 seconds
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_2_7=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Turns to Life</font><br>When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger Energy Body Protection and 90% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy; the effect lasts for 15 seconds. (1 point of energy decrease for every 5 points damage, 60 second cooldown.)
