desc_buf_ng_ws_001_3_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Increase Damage </font><br>Skill damage is increased by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Pronate Chi skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates</font>When attacking, it has 15% chance that the use of the next skill does not cost energy and recovers 312 energy, and increases your skill Damage by 20% for 7 seconds. (Cooldown period: 20 seconds)<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font><br>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger Energy Body Protection and 90% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy; the effect lasts for 15 seconds. (1 point of energy decrease for every 5 points damage)
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_1_9=<font color="#f9fc00">Cleansing breath</font><br>Your attack accuracy is increased dramatically and you are immune to being disarmed or having skills disabled. The effect lasts for 16 seconds and cooldown is 30 seconds.
