desc_buf_ng_xj_001_3_9=<font color="#FF3030">Chi of Peace (self)</font><br> skill damage is increased by 1% for 60 seconds, can stack 15 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_9=<font color="#f9fc00">Chi of Three Purities</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Cleansing breath</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Premium Cleansing breath</font>: 15% of receiving a "Premium Cleansing breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity from Disarm and Seal skill; lasts for 7 seconds.   (recover for 30 seconds) <br><font color="#9932CD">Harmony in Conflict</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 15 times. Also increases player's skill damage by 1% for 60 seconds. The effect can stack 15 layers.
