desc_buf_ng_em_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Body Skill</font><br/>Any enemy who wants to attack you may be affected by a biting chill. This can interrupt the target's current move and freeze the target for a short time. When get attacked, there is a chance to trigger <br/> <font color="#9932CD">Ice Jade Binding</font> which can remove a large part of negative states and increase some external Parry Endurance and internal resistance by 9 in 10 seconds, and your attack will also inflict Yin Damage.
