desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_010_0=Nan Yiwei likes being whipped. This does not help you at all.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_010_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_011_0=Zhou Cong tells you a shocking secret. Lu Yao is more than suspicious, you need to deal with her. (Lu Yao is not here, talk to this farmer.)
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_011_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_012_0=Lu Yao was so sincere. I think I can trust her.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_012_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_013_0=What a liar! I should keep asking.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_013_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_014_0=How dare she lie to me! I will get to the bottom of this!
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_014_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_015_0=I finally learned from Lu Yao who stole the Golden Skull. I should report to Lady Qiu.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_015_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_016_0=Qiu Qingyuan is embarrassed and angry. He's coming for you.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_016_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_017_0=Qiu Qingyuan is dead. Go find Lady Qiu.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_017_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_018_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_bianda_0=Nan Yiwei is a depraved masochist. Whip him to your heart's content, and his.
desc_buff_beiyuan_wy_bianda_1=
desc_buff_beiyuan_xiaoyouxi_001_0=You can enter Lady Qiu's room from the farmer's place to get some evidence against Lu Yao. If the item you found is incorrect, you can keep looking in her room.
