desc_buf_CS_xd_xdj04_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font><br>Parrying an attack makes you enter a state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> changes into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>The more parries made, the greater damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>While <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font> is active, parrying 5 or more attacks makes <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font> capable of Stun.
desc_buf_CS_xd_xdj04_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font><br>Parrying an attack makes you enter a state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> changes into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>The more parries made, the greater damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>While <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font> is active, parrying 5 or more attacks makes <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font> capable of Stun.
desc_buf_CS_xd_xdj04_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Weeping Blood</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> changes into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>
