desc_buf_ng_cf_001_01_5=<font color="#FF3030">Fist Force</font><br>Increase 12 Melee Damage
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_0=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_1=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font><br>Block 120 damage at most
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_2=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font><br>Block 180 damage at most
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_3=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font><br>Block 240 damage at most
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_4=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font><br>Block 320 damage at most
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_02_5=<font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font><br>Block 400 damage at most
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Sky Dragon Force</font><br>Upon each attack, there is a chance to create a Fist Force: increase four Melee Damage. The Fist Force will not be able to be effective for a while once it gets ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked after the Fist Force gets full stacks, the Fist Force will lose and there is a chance to create Force to block 120 damage at most in ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Sky Dragon Force</font><br>Upon each attack, there is a chance to create a Fist Force: increase six Melee Damage. The Fist Force will not be able to be effective for a while once it gets ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked after the Fist Force gets full stacks, the Fist Force will lose and there is a chance to create Force to block 180 damage at most in ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Sky Dragon Force</font><br>Upon each attack, there is a chance to create a Fist Force: increase eight Melee Damage. The Fist Force will not be able to be effective for a while once it gets ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked after the Fist Force gets full stacks, the Fist Force will lose and there is a chance to create Force to block 240 damage at most in ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Sky Dragon Force</font><br>Upon each attack, there is a chance to create a Fist Force: increase ten Melee Damage. The Fist Force will not be able to be effective for a while once it gets ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked after the Fist Force gets full stacks, the Fist Force will lose and there is a chance to create Force to block 320 damage at most in ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Sky Dragon Force</font><br>Upon each attack, there is a chance to create a Fist Force: increase 12 Melee Damage. The Fist Force will not be able to be effective for a while once it gets ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked after the Fist Force gets full stacks, the Fist Force will lose and there is a chance to create Force to block 400 damage at most in ten seconds.
