desc_buf_ng_cf_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font>
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_0=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_1=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>12% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_2=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>15% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_3=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>18% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_4=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>21% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_5=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>25% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_01_6=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font><br>30% damage taken is absorbed
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_02_0=<font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_02_1=<font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 12% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, there is a chance to accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 15% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, there is a chance to accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 18% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, there is a chance to accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 21% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, there is a chance to accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 25% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, you will accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud-Hopping Heart Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance that 30% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks will be absorbed. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Every time you absorb damage, you will accumulate Force. With the Force, your attack will deal extra Hard Damage to the target. The higher your Melee Damage is, the more powerful the Force will be and the higher damage it will deal.
