desc_buf_ng_gm_001_01_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Advancement Of Yin</font>
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_01_1=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font><br>Each attack deals bonus Yin Damage. The greater Internal Attack Damage, the greater bonus Yin Damage.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_01_2=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font><br>Each attack deals bonus Yin Damage. The greater Internal Attack Damage, the greater bonus Yin Damage.
