desc_buf_ng_gm_002_cd_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Recovery</font><br/>Continuous recovery of HP, and a set chance to disable all negative effects.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_02_8=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_03_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_03_2=
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Chaotic Origin</font><br/>If you are attacked while flying skills are disabled, paralyzed or fainted, you will get continuous recovery of HP for three seconds and there is a chance to remove all debuffs. (Direct attacks from enemies that disable flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.) If your HP is less than 50%, there is a chance to recover double HP. Double HP recovery effect cannot be triggered continuously in short period.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_cd2_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_cd2_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Evil</font><br/>Attack Damage will be increased by 1. 5% in each level.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_02_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>Defense will be increased tremendously, and the attack will be accompanied by a large amount of soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Against Worldly Evil</font><br/>When your attack is not parried or you parry attacks successfully, you will get <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Influence. Each stack of Evil Influence will increase attack damage by 1.5% for 20 seconds. It can stack 18 times. If your attack is parried, you lose one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Influence. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven: </font>When the <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Influence wears off, your potential power is activated and defense will be increased by 70%. Your attacks will also deal Soft Damage for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Defense</font><br/>Parry restores large amount of HP and reduce enemy's Parry Endurance Points (Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Heart Manual</font><br/>There is a chance that Parry can trigger Icy Heart Self-protection effect: Parry within 11 seconds can restore HP and reduce enemy's Parry Endurance Points (the amount of recovery is 270% of Attack Damage suffered, and basic maximum recovery is 1,000 points, subject to the Internal Attack Damage. The Parry Endurance Points that enemy loses is 3% of his max Parry Endurance Points. Can be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most), and your Parry Endurance recovery speed will increase extraordinarily when protecting yourself.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade</font><br/>Continuous loss of blood. All recovery effects lowered by 80%. All Defense reduced by 30%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will decrease Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 1.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_02_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each stack will increase Breath by 3.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Elements Mental Skill</font><br/>Each attack can decrease the target's Breath, Spirit and Stamina by one point, and convert them into your Breath for 30 seconds. Each time you attack, there is a 80% chance to get one extra stack of this effect, maximum 57 stacks. Upon attack, there is a chance to deal Soft Damage to the target. The higher the Breath converted, the higher damage you will deal.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_cd_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_cd_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Attack State</font><br/>Ignore 15% Internal and External Defense. Increase 10% Internal and External Attack Damage and 10% Internal and External Attack Critical Hit Damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg02_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Defensive State</font><br/>All damage and critical hit damage received is reduced by 25%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Hidden Prowess</font><br/>Reduce all damage taken by 25%. Decrease critical hit damage by 25%. Nullify your Damage Reduction while attacking. Ignore 15% of the target's Internal and External Defense and increases your damage and critical hit damage done by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_01_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Accumulate Chi</font><br/>Gathering Chi.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_02_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Weaken Enhanced Endurance Status (Yellow)</font><br/>Unable to be locked, blown away, repelled and knocked down.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_03_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_03_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_04_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_04_1=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunset Skill</font><br/>Gather Chi to protect yourself while you cast a skill and while you are attacked. Grant Super Armor for four seconds. While Super Armor is applied when being hit, there is a 30% chance that the target's skill will be interrupted. When your HP is less than 50%, there are 30% chances to remove most of the debuffs. It takes 14 seconds to recharge Chi.
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg02_0=<s>
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg02_1=<s>
