desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_0=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font>
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_1=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font><br>Lose HP continuously.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_2=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font><br>Lose HP continuously.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_3=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font><br>Lose HP continuously.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_4=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font><br>Lose HP continuously.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_01_5=<font color="#9932CD">Miasma</font><br>Lose HP continuously.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Dream Tianxiang Secret</font><br>When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in four seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 10% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Dream Tianxiang Secret</font><br>When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in five seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 12% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Dream Tianxiang Secret</font><br>When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in six seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 14% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Dream Tianxiang Secret</font><br>When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in seven seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, you will deal 17% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Dream Tianxiang Secret</font><br>When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in eight seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, you will deal 20% Damage to the target.
