desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_10=<font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance </font><br>When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> status: Increases Damage of each move in the skill set by 27 points. Increases Damage from the Skill <font color="#FFAE00">God of Lies </font>by an additional 54 points, and increases the Charge distance and speed of the Skills <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Surrender and Feigned Defeat. </font>
desc_buf_CS_jh_qbgf04_2_9=<font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance </font><br>When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> status: Increases Damage of each move in the skill set by 24 points. Increases Damage from the Skill <font color="#FFAE00">God of Lies </font>by an additional 48 points, and increases the Charge distance and speed of the Skills <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Surrender and Feigned Defeat. </font>
