desc_buf_CS_jh_chz06_01_npc_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Flicks At My Disposal</font><br/><br>increases the skill range of <font color="#f9fc00">Take an Oath under Heaven</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Euphemize</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Flick Suddenly</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Flick towards the Sky</font> by 1 meter. Can stack up to 15 times.
desc_buf_CS_jh_chz06_01_npc_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Flicks At My Disposal</font><br/><br>increases the skill range of <font color="#f9fc00">Pointing to the Sky Vowing</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Euphemistic Enlightenment</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Swift Propagation</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Feint Finger Dance</font> by 1 meter. Can stack up to 15 times.
desc_buf_CS_jh_chz06_npc_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Flicks At My Disposal</font><br>On a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Flicks At My Disposal</font> effect to your character: increases the skill range of <font color="#f9fc00">Take an Oath under Heaven</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Euphemize</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Flick Suddenly</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Flick towards the Sky</font> by 1 meter. Can stack up to 15 times.
desc_buf_CS_jh_chz06_npc_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Flicks At My Disposal</font><br>On a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Flicks At My Disposal</font> status effect to your character: increases the skill range of <font color="#f9fc00">Pointing to the Sky Vowing</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Euphemistic Enlightenment</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Swift Propagation</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Feint Finger Dance</font> by 1 meter. Can stack up to 15 times.
