desc_buf_CS_jh_jgjf04_11=<font color="#f9fc00">Wear Nine Tread One</font><br>When you are not in Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain, successfully parrying can get you one <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Light</font>.<br> When you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, successfully parrying gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Shield Armor</font>.<br> When you are on <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, successfully parrying gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant</font>.
desc_buf_CS_jh_jgjf04_12=<font color="#f9fc00">Nine up and one down </font><br>When you are not in Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain, successfully parrying can get you one <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light"</font><br> When you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, successfully parrying gives you <font color="#FFAE00">"Xun Jia" </font><br>Status. When you are on <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, successfully parrying gives you <font color="#FFAE00">"Secret Chant."</font>
desc_buf_CS_jh_jgjf04_2_11=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret Chant </font><br>Each attack adds damage (can be added up to 5 stacks, but being hit subtracts one stack).
