desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_001_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_001_range_0=Tian Shu<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Increase attack power by 30%, but spend extra 5 energy with each attack.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_001_range_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_0=Add Merak effect to nearby players.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_01_0=Seven Stars - Merak cooldown
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_01_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_range_0=Merak<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Increase critical attack rate by 10%, but each of your attacks will have a 10% chance of depleting 1% of your HP.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_002_range_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_0=Add Tian Ji effect to nearby players.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_01_0=Seven Stars - Tian Ji cooldown
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_01_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_range_0=Tian Ji<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Each of your attacks has the vampiric effect of absorbing 50% HP, but you have a 40% of being knocked down when you're attacked.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_003_range_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_0=Add Tian Quan effect to nearby players.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_01_0=Seven Stars - Tian Quan cooldown
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_01_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_range_0=Tian Quan<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Each of your attacks recovers 5 energy, but you have a 40% of being paralyzed when you're attacked.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_004_range_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_0=Add Jade Star effect to nearby players.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_01_0=Seven Stars - Jade Star cooldown
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_01_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_range_0=Jade Star<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Damage you receive from each enemy attack is reduced by 30%, but your attack power is also reduced by 30%, and your Flying Skills and movement are slowed by 40%.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_005_range_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_006_0=Add Open Yang effect to nearby players.
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_006_01_0=Seven Stars - Open Yang cooldown
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_006_01_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_006_1=
desc_buf_hsp_gdj_zyy_wf_006_range_0=Open Yang<br>Receive the ability to Forgive Zheng Yunying, cancelling the reversed state of this effect on him. <br>Each time you strike a critical hit, you get 30% chance of restoring 5% HP for your nearby teammates. If you are attacked, your skills have a 30% chance of being disabled for 2 seconds.
