desc_buf_ng_bh_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 6 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 6 seconds, <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 7 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 7 seconds, <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 8 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 8 seconds, <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 9 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. Deals extra hard damage to targets who have been knocked down, paralyzed or stunned. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 9 seconds, you absorb a certain amount of damage. If you are knocked down, paralyzed or stunned, you absorb greater damage. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmony with Others</font>: The more allies there are near you, the greater the damage you deal with Heaven's Time and the more damage you absorb with Favorable Terrain, up to double the amount. <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 10 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. Deals extra hard damage to targets who have been knocked down, paralyzed or stunned. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 10 seconds, you absorb a certain amount of damage. If you are knocked down, paralyzed or stunned, you absorb greater damage. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmony with Others</font>: The more allies there are near you, the greater the damage you deal with Heaven's Time and the more damage you absorb with Favorable Terrain, up to double the amount. <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 11 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. Deals extra hard damage to targets who have been knocked down, paralyzed or stunned. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 11 seconds, you absorb a certain amount of damage. If you are knocked down, paralyzed or stunned, you absorb greater damage. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmony with Others</font>: The more allies there are near you, the greater the damage you deal with Heaven's Time and the more damage you absorb with Favorable Terrain, up to double the amount. <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Three Emperors' Force (Heaven's Time)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 12 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. Deals extra hard damage to targets who have been knocked down, paralyzed or stunned. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 12 seconds, you absorb a certain amount of damage. If you are knocked down, paralyzed or stunned, you absorb greater damage. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmony with Others</font>: The more allies there are near you, the greater the damage you deal with Heaven's Time and the more damage you absorb with Favorable Terrain, up to double the amount. <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
