desc_buf_ng_jl_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Unholy Moon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 30% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 8 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Unholy Moon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 36% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 9 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Unholy Moon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 42% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 10 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Unholy Moon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 50% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 12 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Unholy Moon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 60% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 15 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
