desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 12% or decrease the target's defense by 12%. Active for 7 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 12% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 12%. Active for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 15% or decrease the target's defense by 15%. Active for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 15% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 15%. Active for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 18% or decrease the target's defense by 18%. Active for 9 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 18% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 18%. Active for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 21% or decrease the target's defense by 21%. Active for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 21% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 21%. Active for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 25% or decrease the target's defense by 25%. Active for 11 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 21% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 25%. Active for 11 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 30% or decrease the target's defense by 30%. Active for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 30% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 30%. Active for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Tidal Wave</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 30% or decrease the target's defense by 30%. Active for 14 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 30% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 30%. Active for 14 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
