desc_buf_ng_ws_001_2_8=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Turns to Life</font><br>Once health drops below 15%, expend Energy to withstand 90% of damage received for 16 seconds.(Convert loss of 6 HP into loss of 1 Energy. 60 second cooldown.)
