desc_buf_ssg_effect_4_80_0=This "<font color="#f9fc00">Spirit</font>" state of the Jade Crystal Bottle produces a <font color="#f9fc00">level 3</font> Smooth Body buff. It increases the cultivation conversion rate by <font color="#f9fc00">100%</font>, maximum Flying Skill points by <font color="#f9fc00">30</font>, and movement speed by <font color="#f9fc00">15%</font>.
