desc_buf_CS_em_qcc_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Allure</font><br/>Each stack can increase<font color="#f9fc00">Shame the Moon and Flowers</font> 0.5 times the amount of recovery<br/>Stacking 4 times while <font color="#f9fc00">Shame the Moon and Flowers</font> is active will effect yellow armor. <br/>
desc_buf_CS_em_qcc_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Enamored the Whole City</font><br/>Each stack increases the recovery amount of <font color="#f9fc00">Shame the Moon and Flowers</font> by 50%.<br/>When using Shame the Moon and Flowers with 4 stacks of Enamored the Whole City, the user then gains Yellow Armor.<br/>When using One Look Enamored the Whole City with 4 stacks of Enamored the Whole City, the user then gains Yellow Armor.
desc_buf_CS_em_qcc_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Enamored the Whole City</font><br/>Each stack increases the recovery amount of <font color="#f9fc00">Shame the Moon and Flowers</font> by 50%.<br/>When using Shame the Moon and Flowers with 4 stacks of Enamored the Whole City, the user then gains Yellow Armor.<br/>When using One Look Enamored the Whole City with 4 stacks of Enamored the Whole City, the user then gains Yellow Armor.
