desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs05_2_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Be Loose, Don't Lose</font><br>Uses the skill <font color="#f9fc00">Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs05_2_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Be Loose, Don't Lose</font><br>Can use <font color="#f9fc00">Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs06_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Law of the Universe</font><br>Parrying an attack grants<font color="#f9fc00">[Stun Spirit and Grasp the Soul]</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">[Ecstatic Soul]</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">[Days of Darkness]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Long Arm of Justice]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Be Loose, Don't Lose]</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">[World Shaking]</font> with a range of 1 meter. Can be stacked upto 5 times while each use consumes a stack. Stacking 5 times grants<font color="#f9fc00">[Transpose Shadow and Soul]</font>, which upon using will grant <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. After using all states will clear.
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs06_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Laws of the Universe</font><br>Successful parry will increase the range of<font color="#f9fc00"> Scare Ghost and Grasp Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Ecstatic Spirit and Wandered Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Days of Darkness</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Justice Has Long Arms</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>, and<font color="#f9fc00"> World Shaking</font> by 1 meter, up to 5 stacks. 1 stack will be depleted upon using. With 5 stacks, if you use <font color="#f9fc00">Shift Soul and Transpose Shadow</font>, you will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. When used, all stacks will be depleted.
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs06_10=<font color="#f9fc00">Laws of the Universe</font><br>Successful parry will increase the range of<font color="#f9fc00"> Scare Ghost and Grasp Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Ecstatic Spirit and Wandered Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Days of Darkness</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Justice Has Long Arms</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>, and<font color="#f9fc00"> World Shaking</font> by 1 meter, up to 5 stacks. 1 stack will be depleted upon using. With 5 stacks, if you use <font color="#f9fc00">Shift Soul and Transpose Shadow</font>, you will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. When used, all stacks will be depleted.
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs06_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Law of the Universe</font><br>Adds the effects of <font color="#f9fc00">[Stun Spirit and Grasp the Soul]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Ecstatic Soul]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Days of Darkness]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Long Arm of Justice]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Be Loose, Don't Lose]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[World Shaking]</font> with a 1 meter range. Each use will consume a stack. Upon stacking 5 times,<font color="#f9fc00">[Transpose Shadow and Soul]</font> will activate and grant <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. After using all states will clear.
desc_buf_CS_jy_tdshs06_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Laws of the Universe</font><br>Increases the range of<font color="#f9fc00"> Scare Ghost and Grasp Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Ecstatic Spirit and Wandered Soul</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Days of Darkness</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Justice Has Long Arms</font>,<font color="#f9fc00"> Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>, and<font color="#f9fc00"> World Shaking</font> by 1 meter. 1 stack will be depleted upon using. With 5 stacks, if you use <font color="#f9fc00">Shift Soul and Transpose Shadow</font>, you will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. When used, all stacks will be depleted.
