desc_buf_CS_single_wdq_0=<s>
desc_buf_CS_single_wdq_1=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP over time. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked for another time, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 30% of your maximum HP.
desc_buf_CS_single_wdq_2=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP over time. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked 2 times, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 60% of your maximum HP.
desc_buf_CS_single_wdq_3=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP over time. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked 3 times, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 90% of your maximum HP.
