desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_hanbingdan_1=Hit by Cold Ice Pellet. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_jiangudan_0=Bone Fortifying Pill - Increases the player's movement speed (Effect will end when attacked)
