desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_langjiwan_0=It increases the speed of Water Walking and the Water-Dotting Jump. It will also recover additional Flying Skill Points when you are in the water or use Water Walking. (Effect will clear when you are attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_langjiwan_1=Roam Pill can increase the speed of Move On Water and Water-Dotting Jump, and the recovery speed of Flying Points in the water. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_lieyandan_0=You were hit by an incendiary projectile (Effect will end when attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_lieyandan_1=Hit by Flame Pellet. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_qihaiwan_0=Recovers additional Flying Skill Points when you are in the water or use Move On Water. (Effect will clear if you are attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_qihaiwan_1=Qi Hai Pill can increase the recovery speed of Flying Points in the water. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_qingshenwan_0=Lightweight Pill - Increases the speed for Move on Water (Effect will end when attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_qingshenwan_1=Swiftness Pill can increase the speed of Move On Water. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_shenxingdan_0=Recovers additional Flying Skill Points while on the land. (Effect will end when attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_shenxingdan_1=Fast Travel Pill can increase the recovery speed of Flying Points on the ground. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_shihuifen_0=You have been blinded by lime power. Temporarily unable to see. (The effect will clear if you are attacked)
desc_buff_jh_item_xiakedao_shihuifen_1=You are attacked by the Lime Powder and cannot see anything temporarily. (The effect clears when you are attacked.)
