desc_buff_wjd_gc_001_1=
desc_buff_wjd_gc_002_0=Damage reduced by 50%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_002_1=Reduces damage taken by 50%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Block the soldier responsible for sending messages as soon as possible.</font>
desc_buff_wjd_gc_003_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Stop these soldiers. They are sending message.</font>
desc_buff_wjd_gc_004_0=Reduces damage received by 30%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_004_1=Gains Yellow Armor effect and reduces damage taken by 30%.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_005_0=Increases Evasion by 20%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_005_1=Gains Yellow Armor effect and increases Evasion Rate by 20%.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_006_0=Movement speed increased by 20%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_006_1=Gains Yellow Armor effect and increases Movement Speed by 20%.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_007_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Severing Swallow</font><br>Upon breaking an enemies defense, within 10 seconds there is a chance to activate Returning Swallow - granting immunity against most control effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_007_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Swallow Killing Skill</font><br>In 10 seconds after your defense is broken, you might use the ultimate skill Swallow Returns and be immune to most control and negative effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_008_0=When Returning Swallow is active, this skill with continuosly replenish some health. The more this skill is stacked, the stronger the effect.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_008_1=Can use the ultimate skill Swallow Returns and recover HP continuously. The more the stacks, the stronger the effect.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_009_0=Reduces the target's defense by 30% and speed by 50%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_009_1=Hurt by the blade, reducing Defense by 30% and Movement Speed by 50%.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_010_0=A loud noise which disables the targets skills and evasion.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_010_1=Affected by Ape Growl, you cannot use skills or flying skills.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_011_0=Attack power is increased by 30% and 5% of damage received if reflected back to the attacker.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_011_1=Increases Attack by 30%, and reflects 5% damage taken.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_012_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Spirit of Bushido</font><br>A nearly perfect defense, grants immunity from most control effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_012_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Bushido Spirit</font><br>Your parry is greatly effective and you are immune to most control and negative effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_013_0=Health and energy are restored by 5% while increasing Flying Skill point consumption by 10%
desc_buff_wjd_gc_013_1=Each stack reduces the recovery of HP and Energy by 5% and increases Flying Skill Points depleted by 10%.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_014_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Kendo Expert</font><br>Land a hit while this is active grants a chance to add a stack of Lesion, while also granting immunity from most control effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_014_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Bushido Spirit</font><br>When hitting the target, there is a chance to inflict a stack of Wound and be immune to most control and negative effects.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_015_0=<font color="#f9fc00">No Blade Taken</font><br>After a parry, your oopoents skills are disabled for 3 seconds.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_015_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Snatch the Opponent's Blade</font><br>Successful parry disables the target's skills for 3 seconds.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_016_0=Disables opponents skills for 3 seconds.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_016_1=Cannot use any skill. The effect lasts 3 seconds.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_017_0=Reduces opponents attack power by 10% and drains their health.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_017_1=Reduces Attack by 10%, and loses HP continuously.
desc_buff_wjd_gc_018_0=Fainted
desc_buff_wjd_gc_018_1=Fainted
desc_buff_wjd_gc_019_0=Absorbs a portion of the damage and deal it back to the attacker.
