desc_eqp_t1_011m_1=Surging Vitality (Level 7)<br>Increases your Break Defense. After executing a 9 hit combo, you will gain Eased Breathing status, greatly increasing Accuracy and Critical Hit rate. This effect can be activated only once in a given time period.
desc_eqp_t4_jjm_1=Bone Brittling Poisonous Garment (7 items)<br>Increases your Internal Skill Defense and grants a chance to render the target weak and feeble, substantially reducing the damage of the target's skills for 4 seconds.
