desc_eqp_wt1_01m_1=Resurgeance (7 items)<br>Increase your Break Defense. After executing a 6+ hit combo, you will gain Eased Breathing status - greatly increasing Accuracy and Critical Hit rate. This effect can be activated only once in a given time period.
desc_eqp_wt2_011m_1=Reverse Yin and Yang (7 items)<br>Increase your ability to bypass Internal Skill Defense. After a 9 hit combo, the target will become confused.
desc_eqp_wt2_01m_1=Cosmic Chaos (Level 7)<br>Increase your ability to bypass Internal Skill Defense. After a 6 hit combo, the target will become confused.
desc_eqp_zzcf_000_1=Too Sharp to Resist (7 Items)<br>Increase your Max HP. After executing a 6+ hit combo, the target's armor will easily break.
