desc_buf_ng_jh_501_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 44 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 44 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 56 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 56 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 70 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 70 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 84 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 84 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 103 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 103 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 464 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 134 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 134 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 600 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 171 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 171 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 770 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Six Realms Lingxiao Supremacy Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 226 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, ignore enemies' Internal Defense Reduction by 8%, recover 226 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 1016 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
