desc_buf_ng_wx_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Five Immortals</font><br>Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 48 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Five Immortals</font><br>Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 65 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Five Immortals</font><br>Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 82 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Five Immortals</font><br>Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 100 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.<br><font color="#9932CD">Insect God Disater</font>: During the period of Overturn Insect, Being critical hit will make you recover 100 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage. Recovery can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds).
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Five Immortals</font><br>Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 119 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.<br><font color="#9932CD">Insect God Disater</font>: During the period of Overturn Insect, Being critical hit will make you recover 119 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage. Recovery can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds).
