desc_buf_ng_wx_002_08_1=Fainted
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 6% for 5 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 9% for 6 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 12% for 7 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 15% for 8 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 18% for 9 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 9 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 21% for 10 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 10 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 25% for 10 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 10 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
