desc_buf_zhenfa_jiebai_07_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Mysterious Water Array - Black Water Surging</font><br>When being attacked, you can get one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Black Water Force</font> state, this state lasts for 20 seconds: after 8 stacks, you can turn this <font color="#FFAE00">Black Water Force</font> to <font color="#FFAE00">Chilly Water Force</font> and shoot it to the attacker. This force will bounce between enemies, deal Soft Damage to enemies and inflict a 10% slow effect. Slow effect lasts for 6 seconds, can stack 5 times.<br>After the <font color="#FFAE00">Black Water Force</font> dissipating you will enter <font color="#FFAE00">Lack of Energy</font> state: unable to gather <font color="#FFAE00">Black Water Force</font> for 20 seconds.
