desc_buf_ng_dm_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 5s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 12% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 5s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 12% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 6s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 15% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 6s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 15% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 7s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 18% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 7s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 18% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 8s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 21% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 8s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 21% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 9s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 25% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 9s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 25% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and Death</font>: Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 10s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 30% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 10s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 30% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and death with the Senate</font> : Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Palm-Leaf Sutra</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 12s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 30% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 12s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 30% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and death with the Senate</font> : Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
