desc_buff_dfsj_ytds01_0=After calcining the heavy sword in the sword oven (364 1534) to get the Coarse Ironwork and getting the Smelting Completed state, you can find Ironmaking Master to claim your rewards (This state will disappear if you leave Yanjing. Please complete Iron Calcining in time).
