desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_03_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Force Conversion</font><br>Release Force Conversion every once in a while, makes unparrying targets deal less damage and increases self defense ability.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_03_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_04_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Breeze Thirteen Sword</font><br>Upon successful parrying there is a chance to get 1 stack of Breeze Sword Spirit. Using A Gentle Breeze Blows and Swords Fly against Wind will cost 1 stack of Breeze Sword Spirit.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_04_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_04_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Breeze Sword Spirit</font><br>Increase critical hit rate by 7% and increase critical hit Damage by 10%, up to 13 stacks.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_04_1_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_05_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Twelve Roads Spilling Blade</font><br>Each attack will convert all the damage dealt into self HP recovery.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_05_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_06_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Blade Dehisce</font><br>Decrease Movement Speed by 50%. Flying Skills disabled.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_06_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Blade Dehisce</font><br>Decrease Movement Speed by 50%. Flying Skills disabled.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_07_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Split Blood</font><br>Continuous lose HP and Flying Skill Points.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_07_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Split Blood</font><br>Continuous lose HP and Flying Skill Points.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_08_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Oven Pure Yang Skill</font><br>Deal continuous damage to nearby targets.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_08_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_09_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Sword Soul Protection</font><br>Have a chance of getting a 15-second Red Super Armor effect when attacked.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_09_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_09_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Super Armor (red)</font><br/>Your skills cannot be disabled. You cannot be thrown, knocked back or knocked down, and you are immune to controllling effects.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_09_1_1=
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_10_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Metallization</font><br/>Upon successful parrying recover self Energy in a fast speed. When receiving damage use Energy to offset most of the damage.
desc_buff_dfsj_ywt_10_1=
