desc_buf_CS_jh_jzbf05_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Speed Fight</font><br>Increases the charging speed and distance of <font color="#f9fc00">"Surprise Attack"</font><font color="#f9fc00"> and "Decisive Battle"</font>. <br>increases movement speed by 50%. Increases amount of damage done by 50%.
