desc_buf_CS_jh_jzbf07_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Counter</font><br/> If Player has the <font color="#f9fc00">"Strategy"</font> status, target will become paralyzed.
desc_buf_CS_jh_jzbf08_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Radius</font><br>Causes damage over time to enemies within the radius Damage is increased when the enemy gets closer to the center of the area of Effect.. <br>The enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds if they leave the area of effect on their own.
desc_buf_CS_jh_jzbf08_10=<font color="#f9fc00">Radius</font><br>Causes continuous damage to enemies within the radius (damage is increased when the enemy gets closer to the center of the aura field); <br>the enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds if they leave the aura field on their own accord.
