desc_buf_CS_jh_plbz05_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Vertical and Horizontal</font><br/>At the time of a successful parry: grants <font color="#FFAE00">Vertical and Horizontal</font> to yourself: while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> to yourself.
