desc_buf_CS_jh_xlsbz03_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Resting Dragon</font><br/>Successful parry has 20% chance to remove 1 buff from the target.
desc_buf_CS_jh_xlsbz03_10=<font color="#f9fc00">Resting Dragon</font><br/>Parrying grants a 50% chance to remove up to 6 stacks of beneficial buffs from the target and a chance for yourself to receive immunity for 3 seconds.
