desc_buf_CS_jh_xlsbz03_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Resting Dragon</font><br/>Parrying grants a 50% chance to clear three buffs.
desc_buf_CS_jh_xlsbz03_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Resting Dragon</font><br/>Parrying grants a 50% chance to clear four buffs.
