desc_buf_Npc_dcg_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad</font><br/>not parrying an enemy's attack has the chance of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font> on the enemy. The effect lasts 9 seconds and can be stacked 8 times.  When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font> has stacked 8 layers, the poison will explode inside the body and cause accumulated poison damage and paralysis for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_Npc_dcg_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad Technique, </font><br/>If you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a probability of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>is increased to level-8, it will explode all poison essence, causing the poison essence damage to accumulate, temporarily causing Hit Recovery and paralyzing them for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_Npc_xdj_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade</font><br/>Specific amount of additional damage to attack. Continuous loss of HP within 8 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Until Death:</font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are reduced by 80%.
desc_buf_Npc_xdj_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade</font><br/>Specific amount of additional damage to attack. Continuous loss of HP within 8 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Until Death:</font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are reduced by 80%.
