desc_buf_ng_em_006_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font>
desc_buf_ng_em_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 15% of the damage you receive while adding 15% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 8% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 18% of the damage you receive while adding 18% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 9% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 21% of the damage you receive while adding 21% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 10% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 25% of the damage you receive while adding 25% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 12% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Secret of the Green Lotus</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 30% of the damage you receive while adding 30% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 15% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_0=Mental Skill of Leisure
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_01_1=Mental Skill of Leisure built-in Cool Down.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_01_2=Mental Skill of Leisure built-in Cool Down.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_01_3=Mental Skill of Leisure built-in Cool Down.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_01_4=Mental Skill of Leisure built-in Cool Down.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_04_1=Next attack will trigger "Mental Skill of Leisure".
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_04_2=Next attack will trigger "Mental Skill of Leisure".
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_04_3=Next attack will trigger "Mental Skill of Leisure".
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_04_4=Next attack will trigger "Mental Skill of Leisure".
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Skill of Leisure</font><br/>After 16 seconds the next attack will deal an additional 1.5x damage, add additional Yang damage and decrease the target's Movement Speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Skill of Leisure</font><br/>After 13 seconds the next attack will deal an additional 1.5x damage, add additional Yang damage and decrease the target's Movement Speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Skill of Leisure</font><br/>After 10 seconds the next attack will deal an additional 1.5x damage, add additional Yang damage and decrease the target's Movement Speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Skill of Leisure</font><br/>After 10 seconds the next attack will deal an additional 1.5x damage, add additional Yang damage and decrease the target's Movement Speed for 3 seconds; however, target's Movement Speed will increase by 25% when near enemies. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font>
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your damage for each attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When using the skill, a chance to increase critical hit rate greatly and deal an additional Splash damage and reduce the affected targets's speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your damage for each attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When using the skill, a chance to increase critical hit rate greatly and deal an additional Splash damage and reduce the affected targets's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your damage for each attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When using the skill, a chance to increase critical hit rate greatly and deal an additional Splash damage and reduce the affected targets's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your damage for each attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When using the skill, a chance to increase critical hit rate greatly and deal an additional Splash damage and reduce the affected targets's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Trap the Dragon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your damage for each attack. <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When using the skill, a chance to increase critical hit rate greatly and deal an additional Splash damage and reduce the affected targets's speed by 40%. <br><font color="#CFB53B">General's Order</font>: When Catch Dragon is triggered, the affected targets cannot use flying skills in 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin </font>
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 15% for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 18% for 9 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 21% for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 25% for 11 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Origin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 30% for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Solar Calamity</font>: When being attacked, gain a chance to inflict the attacker with an attribute-specific damage. Gain the chance to ignore enemy defense, which can directly or indirectly increase your attack power.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden' s Heart</font>
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 6 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 7 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 9 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 9 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes With Yin</font>: While both Advancement Of Yin and Cessation Of Yang are active, grants immunity from most debuffs.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden’s Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: Your hit has a chance to deal bonus (depending on Internal Attack Damage) Yin Damage for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When hit, there's a chance to heal you for some HP (depending on Internal Attack Damage) over 10 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes With Yin</font>: While both Advancement Of Yin and Cessation Of Yang are active, grants immunity from most debuffs.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Maiden's Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Advancement of Yin</font>: Gain a chance to add Yin damage to your attacks for 11 seconds. The stronger your internal skill, the greater damage you inflict. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation of Yang</font>: When attacked, gain a chance to restore HP over 11 seconds. The stronger your internal skill, the more HP you recover. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes with Yin</font>: When Advancement of Yin and Cessation of Yang are both active, gain immunity against many negative conditions.
desc_buf_ng_gm_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Jade Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: When hit, there's a chance to get a cold draft of air to chill the attacker, decreasing the attacker's Movement Speed by 20% for 5 seconds and making the attacker take an additional 10% Yin Damage when hit.<br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat Resist and Cold Resist increase by 10.
desc_buf_ng_gm_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Jade Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: When hit, there's a chance to get a cold draft of air to chill the attacker, decreasing the attacker's Movement Speed by 25% for 6 seconds and making the attacker take an additional 12% Yin Damage when hit.<br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat Resist and Cold Resist increase by 20.
desc_buf_ng_gm_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Jade Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: When hit, there's a chance to get a cold draft of air to chill the attacker, decreasing the attacker's Movement Speed by 30% for 7 seconds and making the attacker take an additional 14% Yin Damage when hit.<br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat Resist and Cold Resist increase by 30.
desc_buf_ng_gm_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Jade Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: When hit, there's a chance to get a cold draft of air to chill the attacker, decreasing the attacker's Movement Speed by 40% for 8 seconds and making the attacker take an additional 17% Yin Damage when hit.<br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat Resist and Cold Resist increase by 45.
desc_buf_ng_gm_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Icy Jade Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: When hit, there's a chance to get a cold draft of air to chill the attacker, decreasing the attacker's Movement Speed by 50% for 10 seconds and making the attacker take an additional 20% Yin Damage when hit.<br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat Resist and Cold Resist increase by 60.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font>
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font><br>When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 8% for 4 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font><br>When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 11% for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font><br>When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 14% for 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font><br>When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 17% for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mental Hold - First Defense</font>: Attacks cause an additional 17% soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Hold</font><br>When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 20% for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mental Hold - First Defense</font>: Attacks cause an additional 20% soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Ice Chi</font><br/>A definite chance of activating<font color="#9932CD">Cold Chi in Body</font><br/><font color="#CFB53B">Sit and Breath has a chance to remove the cold chi.</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Ice Chi</font><br/>A definite chance of activating<font color="#9932CD">Cold Chi in Body</font><br/><font color="#CFB53B">Sit and Breath has a chance to remove the cold chi.</font>
