desc_buf_ng_jh_105_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Ice Chi</font><br/>A definite chance of activating<font color="#9932CD">Cold Chi in Body</font><br/><font color="#CFB53B">Sit and Breath has a chance to remove the cold chi.</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Chi</font><br/>Injects target with a bout of <font color="#FF3030">"Ice Chi"</font> when player strikes enemy successfully. Every time that enemy is attacked thereafter, the chi in his body might cause <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font>, which lead to Rigidity every time he takes damage for 6 seconds. When <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> is present, every time an attack goes through, the enemy takes extra Yin damage.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>the chi will lay latent in the body for a long time and only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Chi</font><br/>Injects target with a bout of <font color="#FF3030">"Ice Chi"</font> when player strikes enemy successfully. Every time that enemy is attacked thereafter, the chi in his body might cause <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font>, which lead to Rigidity every time he takes damage for 7 seconds. When <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> is present, every time an attack goes through, the enemy takes extra Yin damage.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>the chi will lay latent in the body for a long time and only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Chi</font><br/>Injects target with a bout of <font color="#FF3030">"Ice Chi"</font> when player strikes enemy successfully. Every time that enemy is attacked thereafter, the chi in his body might cause <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font>, which lead to Rigidity every time he takes damage for 8 seconds. When <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> is present, every time an attack goes through, the enemy takes extra Yin damage.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>the chi will lay latent in the body for a long time and only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Ice Chi</font><br/>Injects target with a bout of <font color="#FF3030">"Ice Chi"</font> when player strikes enemy successfully. Every time that enemy is attacked thereafter, the chi in his body might cause <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font>, which lead to Rigidity every time he takes damage for 9 seconds. When <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> is present, every time an attack goes through, the enemy takes extra Yin damage.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>the chi will lay latent in the body for a long time and has the chance of triggering <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> by itself. Only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad</font><br/>When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be stacked 8 times at most. . When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Toad Style</font><br/>When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be stacked 8 times at most. . When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Toad Style</font><br/>When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be stacked 8 times at most. . When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Toad Style</font><br/>When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be stacked 8 times at most. . When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad</font><br/>When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be stacked 8 times at most.  When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>has reached level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage, triggering Paralysis for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad Technique</font><br/>If you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a probability of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>is increased to level 8, it will explode all poison essence, causing the poison essence damage to accumulate, temporarily causing HP recovery and paralyzing them for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad Technique</font><br/>If you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a probability of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison </font>is increased to level 8, it will explode all poison essence, causing the poison essence damage to accumulate, temporarily causing HP recovery and paralyzing them for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Poisonous Toad</font><br/>Failing to parry grants a chance to cast <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font>. If the target is Critically Hit at the same time, a stack will be added. When Critical Hitting a target that doesn't parry, there is also a chance to cast <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font>. Active for 9 seconds and can be stacked up to 8 times. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font> reaches 8 stacks, it will trigger a venom explosion that will override the current move and Paralyze for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Star Vortex (level 1)</font><br/>A chance to disperse target's cultivation points during attack. Also causes breath to waver for a specific duration, continuous outflow of energy and movement speed decreased by 40%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demented Star Vortex: </font>absorb the cultivation points dispersed by the target and convert to own Max. limit for HP and energy. Can increase 20 levels. Immunity for all movement restrictions for a specific period of time.
