desc_buf_ng_jh_507_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunflower Manual (level 1)</font><br/>Every attack has the chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks, duration: 15 seconds, If stealing is triggered at the same time, chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a specific period of time.  <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 28 seconds.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunflower Manual (level 1)</font><br/>Every attack has the chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks, duration: 18 seconds, If stealing is triggered at the same time, chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a specific period of time. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 30 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 22 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunflower Manual (level 1)</font><br/>Every attack has the chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks, duration: 21 seconds, If stealing is triggered at the same time, chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a specific period of time. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 32 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 24 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunflower Manual (level 1)</font><br/>Every attack has the chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks, duration: 24 seconds, If stealing is triggered at the same time, chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a specific period of time. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 34 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 27 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunflower Manual (level 1)</font><br/>Every attack has the chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks. Lasts for 27 seconds. If stealing is triggered at the same time, there's a chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a period of time.  <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 36 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 30 seconds. <font color="#CFB53B">Never Defeated:</font> If <font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Chi of Sunflower</font> are both active, you are immune to Stiffness, Knock Back, knock down and knock into air effect. Accuracy rate is also increased.
