desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Purple Rosy Clouds Skill </font><br/>An attack will cause damage equivalent to 0.75 times the Energy your target lacks, and causes an additional 150 Yin damage. Only effective against players.
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Purple Rosy Clouds Skill</font><br/>Your attack can deal an amount of damage equal to 0.8 time as much as the target’s missing Energy, and deal an additional 500 (actual amount is subject to Internal Attack Damage) Yin damage. (This effect is only against players)
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Purple Rosy Clouds Skill</font><br/>Your attacks deal an amount of damage equal to 0.85 times the target's used Energy, and deal an additional 640 (Amount subject to Internal Attack Damage) Yin damage. Also recovers an amount of HP equal to 0.15 times the target's current Energy, along with an additional 640 HP (Only effective on players)
