desc_buf_ng_jy_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark-Heaven Code</font><br/>Activate Murderous Pursuit for 20 seconds, +16% ignore parry for the next 7 attacks, with additional Hardness damage (ignore parry). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When taking direct hits, you have a chance to become enraged, taking 10% less martial arts skill damage for 20 seconds.
