desc_buf_ng_jy_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Dark Heaven Code </font><br/>The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 16 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 28% during next 12 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 18%, and will last 32 seconds.
