desc_buf_ng_jz_003_3=<font color="#f9fc00">The Forgotten Love</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Forget Self and Sword</font>: Each attack has chance to activate the "Forget Self and Sword" effect: Increase attack damage by 4 with an additional 2 points of damage every 2 seconds. Active for 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase sword based damage by 24.
desc_buf_ng_jz_003_4=<font color="#f9fc00">The Forgotten Love</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Forget Self and Sword</font>: Each attack has chance to activate the "Forget Self and Sword" effect: Increase attack damage by 5 with an additional 2 points of damage every 2 seconds. Active for 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase sword based damage by 30.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Tome of Withering Flowers</font><br/>When attacking, there is a chance to attach target with Wind Flower Chi and deal minor Soft damage (max 2 stacks of Chi at the same time). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Shaking Branches: </font>After 6 seconds, Wind Flower Chi blossoms and interrupts target's martial arts skill and haults target's movement, dealing massive Yin damage to target and all nearby enemies. Damaged meridians cause the target to lose HP each time they use a move for 12 seconds.
