desc_buf_ng_jz_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">The Tome of Sacred Flower</font><br/>Each attack has a chance to infuse a stack of "Flying Flower Chi" into the target, dealing small amount of Soft Damage(max 2 stacks). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Shaking Flower Branch: </font>After 6 seconds, Flying Flower Chi blossoms and interrupts target's move and paralyze target, dealing massive Yin damage to target and all enemies nearby. Due to damaged vessels, target will lose HP when launching any moves in 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font>
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for five seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 12% for five seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for six seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 15% for six seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for seven seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 18% for seven seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for eight seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 21% for eight seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for ten seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 25% for ten seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Heaven Demo Dreamland</font>: When being influenced by Demon Song and Addicted Dance at the same time, the target will be in the Dreamland and get confused. He will lose direction and Rage.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 30% for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Heaven Demo Dreamland</font>: When being influenced by Demon Song and Addicted Dance at the same time, the target will be in the Dreamland and get confused. He will lose direction and Rage.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Demon</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Chant</font>: While attacking, there is a chance to emit a shrill sound which inflicts Yin damage over 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Ghostly Dance</font>:When attacked, there is a chance to exhaust the attacker, lowering their attack power by 30% for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Demonic Illusion</font>: Targets under both the Demonic Chant and Ghostly Dance effect will suffer from hallucinations, their movement keys randomized and their Rage will gradually dissipate.
desc_buf_ng_npc_gb_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Mental Skill of Leisure</font><br/>After 10 seconds the next attack will deal an additional 1.5x damage, add additional Yang damage and decrease the target's Movement Speed for 3 seconds; however, target's Movement Speed will increase by 25% when near enemies. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_npc_jl_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Divine Skill of The Shaoyang</font><br/>Each attack infuses Chi into the target. After 10 Chi infusions, target will become confused for 3.5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_npc_jz_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Mingyu Skill</font><br/>Increase base Movement Speed by 33% and add additional damage to attacks. Damage will increase along with your Movement Speed and a chance to knock the target down.
desc_buf_ng_npc_jz_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Love Forgetting Heaven Script</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Forget Sword and Yourself</font>: Each attack has a chance to enter the Forget Sword and Yourself condition: increased five damage per attack, plus an extra five damage every two seconds for 20 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increased 30 damage for your sword.
desc_buf_ng_npc_sl_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Arhat Demon-Subduing Skill</font><br/> Each attack will have a chance to trigger the Animitta condition and a chance to all four marks<br>(only chivalrous people can reach this condition).
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 4% of maximum HP and 3% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 40% of player's maximum HP and 40% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 4.5% of maximum HP and 3.2% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 45% of player's maximum HP and 45% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 5% of maximum HP and 3.4% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 50% of player's maximum HP and 50% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 5.5% of maximum HP and 3.6% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 55% of player's maximum HP and 55% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 6% of maximum HP and 4% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare" </font>buff: Skill damage is increased by 20% for 20 seconds. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, player will recover 6.2% of maximum HP and 4.2% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16m radius of the player when the player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff: Skill damage is increased by 25% for 20 seconds. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 6 seconds, player will recover 6.5% of maximum HP and 4.5% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: Recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16m radius of the player when the player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff: Skill damage is increased by 30% for 20 seconds). <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if player is not attacked again within 6 seconds, player will recover 6.8% of maximum HP and 4.8% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Resurrection</font>: recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16m radius of the player when the player enters Fatal Injury State, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff (effect: skill damage is increased by 30% for 30 seconds). <br>(amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy) <br>(after teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes)
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_9=<font color="#f9fc00">Twenty-Four Secrets of the Golden Lock</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>:Locks incoming attacks for 6 seconds while restoring HP by 7.2% and Energy by 5.2%<br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: When injured, restores HP and Energy to yourself and allies within 16 meters. Additionally it activates <font color="#f9fc00">“Fox Mourns for Dead Hare”</font>: Damage increased by 30% for 30 seconds.<br>(Health and Energy are restored by 60% of their maximum value)<br>(Allies cannot receive this restoration effect aagin for 5 minutes)
