desc_buf_ng_sl_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Sandalwood Altar Skill</font><br/>When attacked, there is a chance of reducing 35% of the damage and activating Sandalwood Fragrance.<br/><font color="#CFB53B">Improving Circulation:</font><br/>Being attacked while Sandalwood Fragrance is active gives a chance to improve circulation.<br/> <font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation:</font><br/>When you have 5 Chi in reserve, you can recover 34% lost blood.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Sandalwood Altar Skill</font><br/>When attacked, there is a chance of reducing 40% of the damage and activating Sandalwood Fragrance.<br/><font color="#CFB53B">Improving Circulation:</font> Being attacked while Sandalwood Fragrance is active gives a chance to improve circulation.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation:</font><br/>When you have 5 Chi in reserve, you can recover 38% lost blood.
