desc_buf_ng_sl_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Sandalwood Altar Skill </font><br/>When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 50%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Blood Stasis Conversion: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 4 wisps of sandalwood incense, 50% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Vigil of Zen</font>
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Vigil of Zen</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 8% within 8 seconds and grants an 8% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Vigil of Zen</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 9% within 9 seconds and grants an 9% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 9 seconds.
