desc_buf_ng_sl_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Vigil of Zen</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 12% within 12 seconds and grants an 12% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Vigil of Zen</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 15% within 15 seconds and grants an 15% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">On the Go</font>: Attacks have a chance to break defense, cause fainting or sealing skills.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Taisu Yin Skill</font><br/>Every attack will bring a negative poison lasting 16 seconds. <font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak</font>: When attacking, a chance to detonate Yin Poison and deal the sum of the poison damage (poison will not dissipate).<br/><font color="#9932CD">Yin Su:</font> After the eruption of <font color="#FF3030">"Yin Poison"</font>, the target will lose 18% blood stasis and make the blood deactivate again. At the same time, the Movement Speed will drop to the limit and then recover gradually in 4 seconds. Grounded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Taisu Yin Skill</font><br/>Every attack will bring a negative poison lasting 16 seconds. <font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak</font>: When attacking, a chance to detonate Yin Poison and deal the sum of the poison damage (poison will not disappear).<br/><font color="#9932CD">Yin Su:</font> After the eruption of <font color="#FF3030">"Yin Poison"</font>, the target will lose 21% blood stasis and make the blood deactivate again. At the same time, the Movement Speed will drop to the limit and then recover gradually in 4 seconds. Grounded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Extreme Yin Magical Skill</font><br/>Every attack will bring a negative poison lasting 16 seconds. <font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak</font>: When attacking, a chance to detonate Yin Poison and deal the sum of the poison damage (poison will not disappear).<br/><font color="#9932CD">Yin Su:</font> After the eruption of <font color="#FF3030">"Yin Poison"</font>, the target will lose 24% blood stasis and make the blood deactivate again. At the same time, the Movement Speed will drop to the limit and then recover gradually in 4 seconds. Grounded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Taisu Yin Skill</font><br/>Every attack will bring a negative poison lasting 16 seconds. <font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak</font>: When attacking, a chance to detonate Yin Poison and deal the sum of the poison damage (poison will not disappear).<br/><font color="#9932CD">Yin Su:</font> After the eruption of <font color="#FF3030">"Yin Poison"</font>, the target will lose 27% blood stasis and make the blood deactivate again. At the same time, the Movement Speed will drop to the limit and then recover gradually over 4 seconds. Grounded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Taisu Yin Skill </font><br/>During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3034">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which will result in the sum of all poison damage The poisons will not disappear). <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 30% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 6 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
