desc_buf_ng_tm_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Meridian Extreme Yin and Soft Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target. Poison effect: Each time the target uses a skill or flying skill, he/she will lose HP, maximum 4 stacks, lasting 30 seconds.
