desc_buf_ng_tm_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Subtlety of Yin</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target. Poison effect: Each time the target uses a skill or flying skill, he/she will lose HP, maximum 5 stacks (Each stack reduces an additional 3% movement damage), lasting 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Extremely Yin and Wet Poison</font>: When Extremely Soft and Cold Poison appears, disable the enemy's skills for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 2% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 2% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 2% and increases general damage by 2%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 3% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 3% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 3% and increases general damage by 3%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 4% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 4% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 4% and increases general damage by 4%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 5% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 5% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 5% and increases general damage by 5%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Mystic Treasure</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 6% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 6% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 6% and increases general damage by 6%. Removed after stacking 5 times.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Chi Becomes Form</font>: Grants a chance to cancel out the targets defensive effects such as damage reduction or damage absorption.
