desc_buf_ng_wg_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Deviant Vampire</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 100 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 18 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
