desc_buf_ng_xd_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font>
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 5% for 5 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 25%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 25% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 10% for 6 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 30%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 30% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 15% for 7 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 35%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 35% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 20% for 8 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 40%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 40% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 25% for 9 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 45%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 45% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 9 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Possessed by the Blood Devil</font>: While your HP goes below 30%, converts (Remaining HP should be no more than 50%.) 75% of the damage you deal into your HP for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Heart</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Your hit has a chance to increase all skill damage dealt by 30% for 10 seconds, as well as to increase Movement Speed by 50%.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Your hit has a chance to render 50% of the effect of target Restores ineffective for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Possessed by the Blood Devil</font>: While your HP goes below 30%, converts (Remaining HP should be no more than 50%.) 100% of the damage you deal into your HP for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Blood Blade Mental Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Ran Amok</font>: Grants a chance to increase damage by 30% and movement speed by 50% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Attacking a target may reduce their restoration skills by 50% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Blood Demon Armor</font>: When your HP drops below 30%, your attacks have a chance within the next 12 seconds to absorb 100% damage as HP as long as your HP remains below 50%.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>: has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 5 seconds, 36 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 2% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>: has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 6 seconds, 34 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 2% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>: has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 7 seconds, 32 seconds cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 3% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>: has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 8 seconds, 30 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 3% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>: has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 9 seconds, 28 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 4% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 10 seconds, 27 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: graceful yet improper, you become invincible; successful evasion recovers 4% of maximum HP and increases your next attack damage by 60%, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Clear Jade Divine Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>:  When attacked there is a 50% chance to increase Evasion by 20% for 11 seconds. 26 second cooldown.<br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: Evading an attack restores 5% HP and increases the damage for your next attack by 60%. 4 second cooldown.
