desc_itembuf_ssf_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Life and Death Rune</font><br/>Slowed by 20%.<br/>Hurry to Lingxiao City and ask <font color="#f9fc00">Gu Yunfeng (537,146)</font> about how to relieve the rune.
