desc_itembuf_ssf_06_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Life and Death Rune</font><br/>Consume an additional 3 Flying Skill Points when using Flying Skills.<br/>Hurry to Lingxiao City and ask <font color="#f9fc00">Gu Yunfeng (537,146)</font> about how to relieve the rune.
desc_itembuf_ssf_07_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Life and Death Rune</font><br/>Crit Rate decreases by 5%.<br/>Hurry to Lingxiao City and ask <font color="#f9fc00">Gu Yunfeng (537,146)</font> about how to relieve the rune.
