desc_buf_clone039_002_range_0=Drop Frozen Frost<br>Reduces Movement Speed by 80%, <br>disables Flying skills, <br>the target loses 20% HP when the status disappears.
desc_buf_clone039_002_range_1=Drop Frozen Frost<br>Reduces Movement Speed by 80%, <br>disables Flying skills, <br>the target loses 20% HP when the status disappears.
desc_buf_clone039_003_0=Target hit by the Ice Needle will immediately freeze, unable to move. The frozen player can leave that state by moving constantly. If the Frozen state remains for 15 seconds, the player will suffer great damage. Damage received when Frozen will double.
desc_buf_clone039_003_1=
desc_buf_clone039_004_0=Extreme Cold<br>Frozen target is Paralyzed. Move constantly to remove this status. <br>If the status remains until it's end, the target will suffer a great amount of damage. <br>Damage received during Frozen state will be doubled.
desc_buf_clone039_004_1=
desc_buf_clone039_004_1_0=Keep moving and you will defreeze soon!
desc_buf_clone039_004_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_005_0=Throat Lock<br>Can be relieved by being clicked by other players. <br>If not released within given time, 90% of HP will be lost. In the status duration every 2 seconds 1% of HP and Energy is lost.
desc_buf_clone039_005_1=
desc_buf_clone039_005_1_0=Throat Lock Target
desc_buf_clone039_005_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_006_0=Ice Ball knocks all the targets on it's way, and affects them with Sparkling Frost Energy. Every time when damage is caused, the player will lose 1% HP and there is a certain chance to enter Silence status for 5 seconds. Sparkling Frost Energy effect lasts 10 seconds.
desc_buf_clone039_006_1=
desc_buf_clone039_006_1_0=Sparkling Frost Energy<br>Every time when damage is dealt, 1% of HP will be lost and there is a certain chance of Silence for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_clone039_006_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_007_0=Ice Ball explodes in 5 seconds
desc_buf_clone039_007_1=
