desc_buf_clone039_007_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_008_0=Targets in the Coldness area will lose 2% of HP very second.
desc_buf_clone039_008_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_0=Knocks back the targets and deals 50% of HP damage. Within the next 10 seconds Movement Speed will be reduced by 60%, and every use of Flying Skills will cause 2% HP damage. At the same time the Snowball can break into icicles.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_1_0=Speed decreased by 60%<br>Use of Flying Skills will cause 2% HP damage.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_2_0=Loses 10% HP every second.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_01_2_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_02_0=Intimidated by the power of Demonic Snow Ape<br>are Paralyzed and Silenced<br>Can be relieved by being clicked by teammates<br>When the effect dissipates, instant kill damage will be caused directly.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_02_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_02_1_0=Directly remove Peacock's Plume, Red Super Armor immunity effect.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_02_1_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_03_0=Damage increases by 200%<br>Each attack has a 50% chance to Break Defense.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_03_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_04_0=Dark Chill<br>Has a chance to get Stunned for 1 second every 4 seconds.
