desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_09_1=
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_10_0=Remove Enraged status, immune to all damage. <br>Deals 10% HP damage to the targets in range every 2 seconds. <br>Being attacked by Demonic Snow Ape will end this state. <br>Dodging the Icicle grants immunity to that damage.
