desc_buf_clone039_xq_ng_0=Sparkling Frost Sutra<br>Using Sparkling Frost Sutra increases Hit Rate. <br>Every attack has a chance to trigger Sparkling Frost Energy. <br>Attacks within 10 seconds have a high chance to inflict Burn, target's damage within 5 seconds is decreased by 30%. <br>When activating Cold, Immune to 20% of Damage for 10 seconds. <br>Sparkling Frost Energy will not be activated at the same time, and withing 20 seconds after activation no other Energy can be used.
