desc_buf_clone_em01_1=
desc_buf_clone_em_0=When dealing damage, there is a chance to recover HP and Energy by 2%. <br>Each attack has a chance to inflict slow recovery of HP for you or nearby allies. Recover 2% HP every second. Last for 10 seconds. This effect will not trigger repeatedly in a short time. <br>Only for Emei and Divine Water Palace.
