desc_buf_clone_gb_0=When dealing damage, there is a chance to recover 4% HP. When attacking the target, there is a chance to increase external critical damage of players within 20 meters by 15%. This effect will not trigger repeatedly in a short time. <br>Only for Beggars' Sect and Changfeng Escort Agency.
