desc_buf_ng_mj_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Blazing Flame</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Certain chance of Scorch the Enemy state when attacking: Increase own Skill Damage for 5 seconds (higher Rage makes higher Damage, minimal increase is 10%, full Rage improves Skill Damage by 30%); <br><font color="#9932CD">Blazing Flame</font>: Chance to get Blazing Flame when being attacked. Adds 10 points of Rage within 5 seconds (effect is activated only once per 30 seconds)
