desc_buf_ng_mj_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Prairie Fire Miracle</font><br>Inflicts Fire Kindle upon attacking the enemy: 73 points of Yang Damage per second. Fire Kindle only follows the Parasite skill use or attack and grows, lasts 8 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking the Fire Kindle target with fire at max triggers Prairie Fire: The Parasite and enemies in range suffer 220 points of Damage and gets the Fire Kindle on the target into the initial state (Prairie Fire may be triggered once per 20 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Prairie Fire Miracle</font><br>Inflicts Fire Kindle upon attacking the enemy: 91 points of Yang Damage per second. Fire Kindle only follows the Parasite skill use or attack and grows, lasts 9 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking the Fire Kindle target with fire at max triggers Prairie Fire: The Parasite and enemies in range suffer 273 points of Damage and gets the Fire Kindle on the target into the initial state (Prairie Fire may be triggered once per 20 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Prairie Fire Miracle</font><br>Inflicts Fire Kindle upon attacking the enemy: 110 points of Yang Damage per second. Fire Kindle only follows the Parasite skill use or attack and grows, lasts 10 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking the Fire Kindle target with fire at max triggers Prairie Fire: The Parasite and enemies in range suffer 329 points of Damage and gets the Fire Kindle on the target into the initial state (Prairie Fire may be triggered once per 20 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Prairie Fire Miracle</font><br>Inflicts Fire Kindle upon attacking the enemy: 129 points of Yang Damage per second. Fire Kindle only follows the Parasite skill use or attack and grows, lasts 11 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking the Fire Kindle target with fire at max triggers Prairie Fire: The Parasite and enemies in range suffer 388 points of Damage, Flying Skills disabled for 3 seconds, and gets the Fire Kindle on the target into the initial state (Prairie Fire may be triggered once per 20 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Prairie Fire Miracle</font><br>Inflicts Fire Kindle upon attacking the enemy: 156 points of Yang Damage per second. Fire Kindle only follows the Parasite skill use or attack and grows, lasts 12 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking the Fire Kindle target with fire at max triggers Prairie Fire: The Parasite and enemies in range suffer 468 points of Damage, Flying Skills disabled for 3 seconds, and gets the Fire Kindle on the target into the initial state (Prairie Fire may be triggered once per 20 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Fire Bath</font>: The Furnace of the Stars, may Prairie Fire: When triggering Prairie Fire, using own Next Rage skill makes 20% more Damage (Return Chi time 30 seconds).
