desc_buf_ng_mj_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Vidyaraja Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font> If you don't attack for 7 seconds, you will enter Unshakable Emperor state: Upon getting attacked Damage taken from skills is reduced by 10% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 30 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: After using skill 7 times, you will enter Wheel Emperor state: Ignore Internal and External Damage Reduction increased by 15% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 24 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Vidyaraja Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font> If you don't attack for 7 seconds, you will enter Unshakable Emperor state: Upon getting attacked Damage taken from skills is reduced by 15% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 30 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: After using skill 6 times, you will enter Wheel Emperor state: Ignore Internal and External Damage Reduction increased by 18% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 24 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Vidyaraja Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font> If you don't attack for 7 seconds, you will enter Unshakable Emperor state: Upon getting attacked Damage taken from skills is reduced by 20% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 30 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: After using skill 5 times, you will enter Wheel Emperor state: Ignore Internal and External Damage Reduction increased by 21% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 24 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Vidyaraja Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font> If you don't attack for 7 seconds, you will enter Unshakable Emperor state: Upon getting attacked Damage taken from skills is reduced by 25% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 30 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: After using skill 4 times, you will enter Wheel Emperor state: Ignore Internal and External Damage Reduction increased by 25% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 24 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Vidyaraja Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font> If you don't attack for 7 seconds, you will enter Unshakable Emperor state: Upon getting attacked Damage taken from skills is reduced by 30% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 30 seconds); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: After using skill 3 times, you will enter Wheel Emperor state: Ignore Internal and External Damage Reduction increased by 30% for 7 seconds (Return Chi time 24 seconds); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Ever Changing Tathagata</font>: In Unshakable Emperor state there is a chance of triggering Ever Changing Tathagata. Next time upon using a skill you will immediately enter Ever Changing Tathagata · Wheel Emperor state (Return Chi time 45 seconds)
