desc_buf_ng_mj_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Attacks have a chance of dealing 115 points of additional Yang Damage (if your Blood Stasis is greater than the enemy's, there will be a 10% Damage bonus) within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 20 seconds, up to 4 times of additional Damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: When you are under attack, there is a chance to absorb 50% of your Blood Stasis Damage within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Attacks have a chance of dealing 139 points of additional Yang Damage (if your Blood Stasis is greater than the enemy's, there will be a 15% Damage bonus) within 6 seconds (Return Chi time 20 seconds, up to 5 times of additional Damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: When you are under attack, there is a chance to absorb 60% of your Blood Stasis Damage within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Attacks have a chance of dealing 164 points of additional Yang Damage (if your Blood Stasis is greater than the enemy's, there will be a 20% Damage bonus) within 7 seconds (Return Chi time 20 seconds, up to 6 times of additional Damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: When you are under attack, there is a chance to absorb 70% of your Blood Stasis Damage within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Attacks have a chance of dealing 215 points of additional Yang Damage (if your Blood Stasis is greater than the enemy's, there will be a 25% Damage bonus) within 8 seconds (Return Chi time 20 seconds, up to 7 times of additional Damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: When you are under attack, there is a chance to absorb 80% of your Blood Stasis Damage within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Attacks have a chance of dealing 299 points of additional Yang Damage (if your Blood Stasis is greater than the enemy's, there will be a 30% Damage bonus) within 9 seconds (Return Chi time 20 seconds, up to 8 times of additional Damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: When you are under attack, there is a chance to absorb 100% of your Blood Stasis Damage within 5 seconds (Return Chi time 40 seconds); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font>: In the end of Move the Sky with a Palm your Blood Stasis value is recovered to 10%.
desc_buf_ng_npc_mj_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Blazing Flame</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Certain chance of Scorch the Enemy state when attacking: Increase own Skill Damage for 5 seconds (higher Rage makes higher Damage, minimal increase is 10%, full Rage improves Skill Damage by 30%); <br><font color="#9932CD">Blazing Flame</font>: Chance to get Blazing Flame when being attacked: Adds 10 points of Rage within 5 seconds (effect is activated only once per 30 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_npc_mj_001_1=
desc_buf_ng_npc_mj_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Sunburst Skill</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Sunburst Protection</font>: When under attack, there is a chance to induce Yang Flaming to self: Reflect 468 points of damage for 5 seconds. In that time 30% of taken Damage will Heal self. Flying Skills disabled, healing effect when Paralyzed or Stunned is doubled.
