desc_buff_wcbz_003_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Recover</font><br>Recovers 10% HP every second in the blood pool.
desc_buff_wcbz_003_1_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_003_2_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Bleeding</font><br>Loses 10% HP every second in the blood pool.
desc_buff_wcbz_003_2_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_004_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Encourage</font><br>When any monster dies, its dying mourning will strengthen its companions within 5 meters, increasing their damage by 100%.
desc_buff_wcbz_004_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_004_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Encourage</font><br>Damage increases by 100%.
desc_buff_wcbz_004_1_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_005_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Toughness</font><br>Increases HP by 40% and Damage by 20%.
desc_buff_wcbz_005_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_006_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Moving</font><br>Moving the treasure chest...
desc_buff_wcbz_006_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_007_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Bonds</font><br>Every attack has great chance of causing the target to slow down and disable their flying skill.
desc_buff_wcbz_007_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_007_1_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Stagger</font><br>Movement speed decreases significantly, and unable to use Flying Skill.
desc_buff_wcbz_007_1_1=
desc_buff_wcbz_008_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Treasure Trigger</font><br>Only you can move the treasure in the cave. Others can assist you.
desc_buff_wcbz_008_1=
