desc_buf_ng_jh_214_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 5 times: reflect at least 35 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 5 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 6 times: reflect at least 43 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 6 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 7 times: reflect at least 53 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 7 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 59 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 68 external damage when attacked within 6 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds; <br>While receiving <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font>, also receive 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">"Qi Purge"</font>: recover 554 HP after 5 seconds (each stack of "Qi Purge" adds more recovery). One stack of "Qi Purge" is deducted every time skill is used within this time period.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 79 external damage when attacked within 7 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds; <br>While receiving <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font>, also receive 6 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">"Qi Purge"</font>: recover 719 HP after 5 seconds (each stack of "Qi Purge" adds more recovery). One stack of "Qi Purge" is deducted every time skill is used within this time period.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 91 external damage when attacked within 8 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds; <br>While receiving <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font>, also receive 7 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">"Qi Purge"</font>: recover 906 HP after 5 seconds (each stack of "Qi Purge" adds more recovery). One stack of "Qi Purge" is deducted every time skill is used within this time period.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_8=<font color="#f9fc00">Heart Purification Seal</font><br> Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 10 times: reflect at least 103 external damage when attacked within 9 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 10 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds; <br>While receiving <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font>, also receive 8 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">"Qi Purge"</font>: recover 1107 HP after 5 seconds (each stack of "Qi Purge" adds more recovery). One stack of "Qi Purge" is deducted every time skill is used within this time period.
