desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 50% and increase damage taken by 7% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 10% for 3 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 60% and increase damage taken by 10% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 15% for 3 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 70% and increase damage taken by 13% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 20% for 4 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 80% and increase damage taken by 16% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 25% for 4 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 90% and increase damage taken by 20% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 30% for 5 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground; <br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: After <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> ends, enemy randomly gains one out of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disable, Disarm, Paralyze, Flying Skill Disable, Slow-down</font> effects, lasts 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 100% and increase damage taken by 25% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 35% for 5 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground; <br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: After <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> ends, enemy randomly gains one out of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disable, Disarm, Paralyze, Flying Skill Disable, Slow-down</font> effects, lasts 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls</font><br><font color="#FF3030"> Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 100% and increase damage taken by 30% for 6 seconds when attacking. Effect multiplied when target is in mid-air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 40% for 6 seconds when attacked. Damage reduction multiplied when on ground; <br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: After <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> ends, enemy randomly gains one out of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disable, Disarm, Paralyze, Flying Skill Disable, Slow-down</font> effects, lasts 2 seconds. Then gains one more out of the <font color="#f9fc00">rest of the debuffs</font> when the first one is over, lasts 2 seconds.
