desc_buf_adv034_fyc_05_0=Music of Watching Moon<br>When you play music, you are immune to all damage, and you recover 1% HP every 2 seconds. <br>When you finish playing music, you recover 20% HP, and in the next 30 seconds all targets within 20 meters of you will not recover any HP. <br>If the fan is destroyed, then the playing will be interrupted.
