desc_buf_adv034_hbz_01_0=Spirit Guard Heaven Essence. <br>Players within 10 meters lose 10% HP every second. <br>Every time you use the skill, you will reset the effect, and add one stack of Black Piece.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_01_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_02_0=Qiankun Black Piece. <br>Black Piece will instantly kill all players in the scene in 30 seconds. <br>Players with White Piece buff will deal extra damage to Qiankun Black Piece.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_02_1=Qiankun Black Piece. <br>Black Piece will instantly kill all players in the scene in 30 seconds. <br>Players with White Piece buff will deal extra damage to Qiankun Black Piece.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_03_0=Black Piece - Break. <br>Deal damage of a player's 20% HP every 3 seconds, when close to White Piece players.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_03_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_04_0=Instantly kill White Piece.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_04_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_05_0=Four Troubles Circulate. <br>Pull players within 10 meters towards the center every 2 seconds. <br>When the state ends, all targets within the area will suffer great damage. <br>If the target has White Piece buff, then it will receive Four Troubles buff.
