desc_buf_adv034_hbz_jz_01_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_01_0=Black and White Weiqi Record. <br>Every attack has a chance to apply White Piece buff to the target. With White Piece buff, the target will have damage dealt reduced by 30% and damage received increased by 30%. <br>Whenever attacked, there is a chance to apply to self Black Piece buff. With Black Piece buff, damage dealt is increased by 10% and damage received is reduced by 10%. <br>Black Piece buff can be stacked for 8 times at most.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_01_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_02_0=White Piece. <br>Damage dealt is reduced by 30%. <br>Damage received is increased by 30%. <br>Can deal a large amount of damage to Qiankun Black Piece.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_02_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_03_0=Black Piece. <br>Damage received is reduced by 10%. <br>Damage dealt is increased by 10%. <br>Once there are 8 stacks, one can not stack it anymore within a short amount of time.
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_03_1=
desc_buf_adv034_hbz_ng_cd_0=Black Piece - Surround. <br>One can not stack Black Piece buff anymore within a short amount of time.
