desc_buf_ng_npc_ts_001_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Soul Secret</font> <br>After 5 attacks, the following attack will deal 234 additional Yin damage to the enemies (Ignore defense and parry. Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage)
