desc_buf_ng_npc_ts_002_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Moonset Manual</font> <br>For every 5 attacks, the next attack within 5 seconds will heal 234 HP and 5% of maximum energy, or reflect 234 yin damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power, and with a cool down time of 10 seconds).
desc_buf_ng_npc_ts_002_1=
desc_buf_ng_npc_ts_003_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Spirit Crane Manual</font> <br><font color="#FF3030">Crane Flies South</font>: Attacking will release continuous bouncing <font color="#FF3030">Crane Chi</font> between enemies and yourself. The bouncing will increase 6% of your damage and <font color="#f9fc00">speed you up by 10%</font>. The bouncing will also increase 6% of damage taken by the enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">slow them down by 10%</font>. The two effects can stack at most 5 times (cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Light as Crane</font>: Reduce energy cost by 10%.
