desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font>
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font><br>Every second, you gain one stack of Snow Protection Chi.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font><br>Every second, you gain one stack of Snow Protection Chi.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font><br>Every second, you gain one stack of Snow Protection Chi.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font><br>Every second, you gain one stack of Snow Protection Chi.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Cold Plum Protection</font><br>Every second, you gain one stack of Snow Protection Chi.
