desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hq_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Every stack will reduce your chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, reduce critical damage you receive by 1%, and transfer that to the attacker.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hq_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Every stack will reduce your chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, reduce critical damage you receive by 1.5%, and transfer that to the attacker.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hq_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Every stack will reduce your chance of being critical hit by 1%, reduce critical damage you receive by 2%, and transfer that to the attacker.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hq_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Every stack will reduce your chance of being critical hit by 1%, reduce critical damage you receive by 2.5%, and transfer that to the attacker.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hq_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Every stack will reduce your chance of being critical hit by 1.5%, reduce critical damage you receive by 3%, and transfer that to the attacker.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font>
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Slow down by 5%, increase the chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, and increase the critical damage received by 1%.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Slow down by 5%, increase the chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, and increase the critical damage received by 1.5%.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Slow down by 5%, increase the chance of being critical hit by 1%, and increase the critical damage received by 2%.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Slow down by 5%, increase the chance of being critical hit by 1%, and increase the critical damage received by 2.5%.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_01_hqcs_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Snow Protection Chi</font><br>Slow down by 10%, increase the chance of being critical hit by 1.5%, and increase the critical damage received by 3%.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Plum Shadow Lift</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: When attacked, you will gain one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> every second. Every stack reduces your chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, and reduces critical damage you receive by 1%. It lasts 12 seconds, and can be stacked for 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will be transferred to the enemy when you are attacked. Every stack slows the enemy down by 5%, increases the chance of the enemy being critical hit by 0.5%, and increases the critical damage that the enemy receives by 1% (the cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: When <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font> ends, your attacks within 6 seconds will have 73 points of extra yin damage per hit (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more cold chi the enemy has, the higher the extra damage is.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Plum Shadow Lift</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: When attacked, you will gain one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> every second. Every stack reduces your chance of being critical hit by 0.5%, and reduces critical damage you receive by 1.5%. It lasts 12 seconds, and can be stacked for 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will be transferred to the enemy when you are attacked. Every stack slows the enemy down by 5%, increases the chance of the enemy being critical hit by 0.5%, and increases the critical damage that the enemy receives by 1.5% (the cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: When <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font> ends, your attacks within 6 seconds will have 91 points of extra yin damage per hit (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more cold chi the enemy has, the higher the extra damage is.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Plum Shadow Lift</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: When attacked, you will gain one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> every second. Every stack reduces your chance of being critical hit by 1%, and reduces critical damage you receive by 2%. It lasts 12 seconds, and can be stacked for 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will be transferred to the enemy when you are attacked. Every stack slows the enemy down by 5%, increases the chance of the enemy being critical hit by 1%, and increases the critical damage that the enemy receives by 2% (the cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: When <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font> ends, your attacks within 6 seconds will have 110 points of extra yin damage per hit (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more cold chi the enemy has, the higher the extra damage is.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Plum Shadow Lift</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: When attacked, you will gain one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> every second. Every stack reduces your chance of being critical hit by 1%, and reduces critical damage you receive by 2.5%. It lasts 12 seconds, and can be stacked for 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will be transferred to the enemy when you are attacked. Every stack slows the enemy down by 5%, increases the chance of the enemy being critical hit by 1%, and increases the critical damage that the enemy receives by 2.5% (the cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: When <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font> ends, your attacks within 6 seconds will have 129 points of extra yin damage per hit (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more cold chi the enemy has, the higher the extra damage is.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Plum Shadow Lift</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: When attacked, you will gain one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> every second. Every stack reduces your chance of being critical hit by 1.5%, and reduces critical damage you receive by 3%. It lasts 12 seconds, and can be stacked for 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will be transferred to the enemy when you are attacked. Every stack slows the enemy down by 5%, increases the chance of the enemy being critical hit by 1.5%, and increases the critical damage that the enemy receives by 3% (the cool down is 30 seconds). <br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: When <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font> ends, your attacks within 8 seconds will have 156 points of extra yin damage per hit (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more cold chi the enemy has, the higher the extra damage is.
