desc_buf_ng_ts_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Sky Score</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When you attack, there is a chance to add 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> buff that lasts 8 seconds to the enemy. It will cause continuous hard damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more the buff stacks, the more the damage is. Attacking the owner of the chi can send the chi back to the owner. <br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When attacked, you will heal HP continuously within 6 seconds. If you are attacked by enemies who have <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font>, then your healing effect will be reinforced.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Sky Score</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When you attack, there is a chance to add 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> buff that lasts 9 seconds to the enemy. It will cause continuous hard damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more the buff stacks, the more the damage is. Attacking the owner of the chi can send the chi back to the owner. <br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When attacked, you will heal HP continuously within 7 seconds. If you are attacked by enemies who have <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font>, then your healing effect will be reinforced.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Sky Score</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When you attack, there is a chance to add 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> buff that lasts 10 seconds to the enemy. It will cause continuous hard damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more the buff stacks, the more the damage is. Attacking the owner of the chi can send the chi back to the owner. <br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When attacked, you will heal HP continuously within 8 seconds. If you are attacked by enemies who have <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font>, then your healing effect will be reinforced.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Sky Score</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When you attack, there is a chance to add 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> buff that lasts 11 seconds to the enemy. It will cause continuous hard damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more the buff stacks, the more the damage is. Attacking the owner of the chi can send the chi back to the owner. <br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When attacked, you will heal HP continuously within 9 seconds. If you are attacked by enemies who have <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font>, then your healing effect will be reinforced.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Sky Score</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When you attack, there is a chance to add 8 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> buff that lasts 12 seconds to the enemy. It will cause continuous hard damage (scaling with respect to melee power and internal power). The more the buff stacks, the more the damage is. Attacking the owner of the chi can send the chi back to the owner. <br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When attacked, you will heal HP continuously within 10 seconds. If you are attacked by enemies who have <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font>, then your healing effect will be reinforced.
