desc_buf_ng_ts_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Classic Thunder Tone</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> true chi will damage the enemies. 15% of all damage that you receive within 8 seconds will explode after the 8 seconds. During the period, every attack (at most 3 times) will increase the internal damage by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When attacked, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> true chi will heal you. 30% of all damage that you receive within 6 seconds will transfer into HP after the 6 seconds. During the period, every time you get attacked (at most 3 times), the transfer effect will be increased by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Classic Thunder Tone</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> true chi will damage the enemies. 20% of all damage that you receive within 8 seconds will explode after the 8 seconds. During the period, every attack (at most 3 times) will increase the internal damage by 5%. (Cool down is 38 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When attacked, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> true chi will heal you. 30% of all damage that you receive within 6 seconds will transfer into HP after the 6 seconds. During the period, every time you get attacked (at most 3 times), the transfer effect will be increased by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Classic Thunder Tone</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> true chi will damage the enemies. 25% of all damage that you receive within 8 seconds will explode after the 8 seconds. During the period, every attack (at most 3 times) will increase the internal damage by 5%. (Cool down is 36 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When attacked, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> true chi will heal you. 30% of all damage that you receive within 6 seconds will transfer into HP after the 6 seconds. During the period, every time you get attacked (at most 3 times), the transfer effect will be increased by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Classic Thunder Tone</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> true chi will damage the enemies. 30% of all damage that you receive within 8 seconds will explode after the 8 seconds. During the period, every attack (at most 3 times) will increase the internal damage by 5%. (Cool down is 34 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When attacked, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> true chi will heal you. 30% of all damage that you receive within 6 seconds will transfer into HP after the 6 seconds. During the period, every time you get attacked (at most 3 times), the transfer effect will be increased by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Classic Thunder Tone</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> true chi will damage the enemies. Within 8 seconds, the damage that you receive will be increased by 15%. 35% of all damage that you receive within 8 seconds will explode after the 8 seconds. During the period, every attack (at most 4 times) will increase the internal damage by 5%. (Cool down is 32 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When attacked, there is a chance <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> true chi will heal you. 30% of all damage that you receive within 6 seconds will transfer into HP after the 6 seconds. During the period, every time you get attacked (at most 4 times), the transfer effect will be increased by 5%. (Cool down is 40 seconds.)
