desc_buf_clone043_jll_02_0=Inflict nearby targets with Cobweb randomly
desc_buf_clone043_jll_02_01_0=Cobweb <br>Reduces movement speed by 30%.<br>Cobweb will be stacked every time you move or use flying skills.<br>When reaching 5 stacks, the targets wrapped by the cobweb will be paralyzed and stunned.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_02_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_02_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_03_0=Spider Insect<br>Summons a invincible spider every 5 seconds. All the targets within 20 meters lose 50% HP in 2 seconds, with flying skill disabled and movement speed reducing by 90%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_03_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_04_0=Spider Poison<br>All the targets lose 50% HP, with flying skill disabled and movement speed reducing by 90%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_04_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_05_0=Spider Poison<br>Decrease movement speed by 90%. Disable Flying skills.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_05_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_06_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_07_0=Heavenly Cobweb Insect<br>Increases movement speed by 10%<br>Can stack 10 times.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_07_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_08_0=Golden Toad Poison<br>Targets in the target area will get Golden Toad - Live. <br>When the Golden Toad moves, a poison circle will be generated under its feet.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_08_1=Golden Toad Poison<br>Targets in the target area will get Golden Toad - Live. <br>When the Golden Toad moves, a poison circle will be generated under its feet.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_09_0=Golden Toad - Live<br>Increases movement speed by 100%<br>Removes and immune to most skill buffs.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_09_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_10_0=Golden Toad Poison<br>A poison circle will be generated under the feet every 10 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_10_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_11_0=Golden Toad Poison - Toxic<br>Enemies in the target area lose 30% HP every 2 seconds and get Golden Toad Poison - Fatal.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_11_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_12_0=Golden Toad Poison - Fatal<br>Removes and immune to most skill buffs. Gets double damage under this debuff.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_12_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_13_0=Scorpion Miasma Sting
desc_buf_clone043_jll_13_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_14_0=Scorpion Miasma Sting<br>Reduces movement speed by 50%, dodge rate by 90% and hit rate by 90%.<br>Unable to block.<br>When casting skills, there's a chance to infect the debuff to 2 nearby allies.<br>When the effect ends, deals seckill damage to all the targets within 50 meters.<br>Players poisoned by Scorpion Miasma Sting will not be affected by Golden Toad Poison - Toxic after getting Golden Toad Poison - Toxic and Scorpion Miasma Sting will be removed.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_14_01_0=Scorpion Miasma Sting<br>About to infect
desc_buf_clone043_jll_14_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_14_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_15_0=Scorpion Miasma Poison<br>Immune to Golden Toad Poison - Toxic for a short time.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_15_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_16_0=Burning Poison<br>Poisons the enemies in the air.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_16_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_17_0=Burning Poison<br>When casting skills, loses 20% Energy. When the effect ends, if the Energy is below 30%, all the targets within 10 meters will lose 90% HP. If player dies from this effect, grants Bone Corrosion.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_17_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_18_0=Burning Poison - Venom<br>When poisoned, loses 90% HP and reduces external and internal skill defense significantly. If player dies from this effect, grants Bone Corrosion.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_18_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_19_0=Bone Corrosion<br>All attributes reduce by 80%<br>This effect will not be removed even if you die and leave the scene.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_19_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_20_0=Breath Protection<br>HP recovery is not allowed within 8 meters. When getting critical hit, recovers 0.5% HP.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_20_1=Breath Protection<br>HP recovery is not allowed within 8 meters. When getting critical hit, recovers 0.5% HP.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_20_range_0=Breath Protection<br>HP recovery reduces by 100%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_20_range_1=Breath Protection<br>HP recovery reduces by 100%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_21_0=Breath Devouring<br>Loses 5% HP every 3 seconds<br>When taking damage, gets 50% extra Yin damage<br>If you have Cobweb, Golden Toad Poison and Scorpion Miasma Sting effect, you will be blind and Brawn and Breath reduce by 90%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_21_01_0=Breath Devouring<br>Loses 5% HP every 3 seconds<br>When taking damage, gets 50% extra Yin damage<br>If you have Cobweb, Golden Toad Poison and Scorpion Miasma Sting effect, you will be blind and Brawn and Breath reduce by 90%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_21_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_21_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_22_0=Breath Devouring - Ineptitude<br>Becomes blind and Brawn and Breath reduce by 90%.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_22_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_01_0=Fickle Lethal Insect<br>When HP is below 50%, every time you deal damage, you will get different buffs when the target receive different debuffs. <br><font color="#FF3030">Cobweb</font>: Gets Thick Soil Chi for 10 seconds. Immune to 80% damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Golden Toad Poison</font>: Gets Sharp Gold Chi for 30 seconds. All damage deals extra HP loss. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Scorpion Miasma Sting</font>: Gets Moist Wood Chi for 22 seconds. Recovers 2% HP every 5 seconds. This effect will be interrupted with a very small chance when getting critical hit. <br><font color="#DA70D6">Burning Poison</font>: Gets Evil Fire Chi for 20 seconds. The external skill defense reduces by 80% in 10 meters. <br><font color="#FFA500">Breath Devouring</font>: Gets Heavy Water Chi for 20 seconds. The hit targets may disarm for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_02_0=Fickle Lethal Insect<br>Insect starts
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_02_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_03_0=Thick Soil Chi<br>Immune to 80% damage.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_03_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_04_0=Sharp Gold Chi<br>All damage deals extra HP loss.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_04_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_05_0=Moist Wood Chi<br>Recovers 2% HP every 5 seconds. This effect will be interrupted with a very small chance when getting critical hit.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_05_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_06_0=Evil Fire Chi<br>The external skill defense reduces by 90% in 10 meters.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_06_1=Evil Fire Chi<br>The external skill defense reduces by 90% in 10 meters.
