desc_buf_clone043_jll_ng_08_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_zj_01_0=When parrying, there's a chance to trigger Five Fatal Insects, inflicting extra yin, yang, hard, soft external and internal damage to the target for a while.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_zj_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jll_zj_02_0=Five Fatal Insects<br>Inflicts extra yin, yang, hard, soft external and internal damage.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_zj_02_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_01_0=Chant Everywhere
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_02_0=Chant Everywhere<br>Stuns for 5 seconds and deals tons of damage to all the targets.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_02_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_03_0=Seamless Palm Shadow<br>Deals tons of damage to the enemies with Chant effect.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_03_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_04_0=Divine Temper<br>Grants Divine Temper to 5 random enemies.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_04_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_05_0=Divine Temper<br>When moving or dealing damage, Crimson Pearl Fairy recovers 0.5% HP. Divine Temper will be stacked and infected to players within 20 meters. Divine Temper can be stacked 3 times until the player dies. <br>After Divine Temper ends, Solid Body will be obtained.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_05_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_06_0=Solid Body<br>Damage dealt increases by 50%.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_06_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_07_0=Chi Entanglement<br>Decreases movement speed by 80%
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_07_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_08_0=Pure Temper Shadow<br>A divine shadow will be summoned under the feet of Crimson Pearl Fairy every 20 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_08_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_09_0=Pure Temper Shadow<br>Within 10 meters of the divide shadow, Crimson Pearl Fairy's damage received reduces by 100% and damage dealt increases by 100%.<br>After entering the area, players will lose 60% HP (ignore most immunity) and get Shadow Possessed for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_09_1=Pure Temper Shadow<br>Within 10 meters of the divide shadow, Crimson Pearl Fairy's damage received reduces by 100% and damage dealt increases by 100%.<br>After entering the area, players will lose 60% HP (ignore most immunity) and get Shadow Possessed for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_09_range_0=Pure Temper Shadow<br>Damage received reduces by 100% and damage dealt increases by 100%.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_09_range_1=Pure Temper Shadow<br>Damage received reduces by 100% and damage dealt increases by 100%.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_10_0=Pure Temper Shadow<br>Lose 60% HP (ignore most immunity) and get Shadow Possessed for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_10_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_11_0=Shadow Possessed<br>When casting skills, Crimson Pearl Fairy recovers 0.2% HP.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_11_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_ng_01_0=Pure Bright Mirror<br>The enemy's Internal Attack Damage reduces by 90% and internal and external defense reduce by 80% within 10 meters.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_ng_01_1=Pure Bright Mirror<br>The enemy's Internal Attack Damage reduces by 90% and internal and external defense reduce by 80% within 10 meters.
