desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_00_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_01_0=Sacrifice Star Perish<br>HP recovery reduces by 50% and lose 3% HP every 3 seconds.<br>Evolve to Sacrifice Star Perish - Tangle in 5 minutes.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_01_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_02_0=Sacrifice Star Perish - Tangle<br>HP recovery reduces by 50% and lose 3% HP every 3 seconds.<br>Every time you deal damage, you may lose some Energy.<br>Evolve to Sacrifice Star Perish - Forget in 5 minutes.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_02_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_03_0=Sacrifice Star Perish - Forget<br>HP recovery reduces by 50% and lose 3% HP every 3 seconds.<br>Every time you deal damage, you may lose some Energy.<br>Internal and External Attack Damage reduce by 50%<br>Evolve to Sacrifice Star Perish - Gloom in 5 minutes.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_03_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_04_0=Sacrifice Star Perish - Gloom<br>Lose 3% HP every 3 seconds.<br>Every time you deal damage, you may lose some Energy.<br>Internal and External Attack Damage reduce by 50%<br>HP recovery reduces by 100% and movement speed reduces by 90%<br>Evolve to Sacrifice Star Perish - Perish in 5 minutes.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_04_1=
