desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_05_1=
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_06_0=Death Star<br>All attributes reduce by 80% and HP reduces to 100<br>This effect will not be removed even if you die and leave the scene.
desc_buf_clone043_jzx_wf_06_1=
