desc_tlcard_buff_01_0=desc_tlcard_buff_01_0
desc_tlcard_buff_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Willful Prodigal</font><br><font color="#00ff00">The earth is not worth it, but the card draw is.</font><br>Whether it's a righteous approach or a scheming little tactic, he will give you positive and direct instructions to settle things sharply or simply leave. You will never get an ambiguous answer. <br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Willful Prodigal</font><br><font color="#00ff00">The earth is not worth it, but the card draw is.</font><br>Whether it's a righteous approach or a scheming little tactic, he will give you positive and direct instructions to settle things sharply or simply leave. You will never get an ambiguous answer. <br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_01_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Willful Prodigal</font><br><font color="#00ff00">The earth is not worth it, but the card draw is.</font><br>Whether it's a righteous approach or a scheming little tactic, he will give you positive and direct instructions to settle things sharply or simply leave. You will never get an ambiguous answer. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Your HP increases by 300 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_02_0=desc_tlcard_buff_02_0
desc_tlcard_buff_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Juggler</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Simply can't stop...</font><br>Giving you creative suggestions to solve difficulties and open up new innings. <br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_02_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Juggler</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Simply can't stop...</font><br>Giving you creative suggestions to solve difficulties and open up new innings. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Your Flying Skill Value increases by 5 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_02_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Juggler</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Simply can't stop...</font><br>Giving you creative suggestions to solve difficulties and open up new innings. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Your Flying Skill Value increases by 10 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
