desc_tlcard_buff_22_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Incomparable Talent</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Obviously you can live by your face, but you only rely on your talent</font><br>Cleverly reconciling the four elements of heaven and earth, forming a source of powerful energy that does not require you to cultivate it, it can naturally find your wavelength, resonate with you, and transmit messages to you. <br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_22_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Incomparable Talent</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Obviously you can live by your face, but you only rely on your talent</font><br>Cleverly reconciling the four elements of heaven and earth, forming a source of powerful energy that does not require you to cultivate it, it can naturally find your wavelength, resonate with you, and transmit messages to you. <br><font color="#FFAE00">All your basic stats increases by 10 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_22_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Incomparable Talent</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Obviously you can live by your face, but you only rely on your talent</font><br>Cleverly reconciling the four elements of heaven and earth, forming a source of powerful energy that does not require you to cultivate it, it can naturally find your wavelength, resonate with you, and transmit messages to you. <br><font color="#FFAE00">All your basic stats increases by 15 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
desc_tlcard_buff_22_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Spiritual Card - Incomparable Talent</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Obviously you can live by your face, but you only rely on your talent</font><br>Cleverly reconciling the four elements of heaven and earth, forming a source of powerful energy that does not require you to cultivate it, it can naturally find your wavelength, resonate with you, and transmit messages to you. <br><font color="#FFAE00">All your basic stats increases by 20 points</font><br><br><font color="#FF0000">Double click to cancel the card effect in advance. You can make Spiritual Divination again after the previous countdown ends.</font>
