desc_buf_clone044_gmsz_08_1=
desc_buf_clone044_gmsz_ng_01_0=Enlightenment of the Void<br>There is a chance of getting a stack of Enlightenment when getting hit. When stacked 10 times, you will get Void state.<br>Void state absorbs 80% of Damage. there is a chance of removing a stack of Enlightenment with each hit on target while the status is active.<br>Once Enlightenment is completely removed, Void effect disappears and there is a chance of inflicting The Great Void on 6 random targets within 10 meters.<br>The Great Void decreases Damage by 50%.
