desc_buf_clone045_gwd_ng_0=Affectionate Brutality<br>Joy: Decreases own Damage by 30%. Disperses the attacker's Energy when getting attacked, losing 1% Energy per second for 10 seconds. Accumulate Anger when getting attacked. After certain amount of attacks, inflict Damage to everyone on the field once and stun them for 3 seconds and enter Rage. <br>Rage: Increase own Damage by 30%. There is a chance to make the target unable to parry when getting attacked. Accumulate Lacking Will when getting attacked. After a certain amount of attacks, inflict Damage to everyone on the field once and disarm them for 3 seconds and enter Joy.
