desc_buf_clone045_srj_ng_0=Summon Demons and Monsters upon entering the battle and grant self 4 stacks of Demons and Monsters. Each stack grants 20% Damage Reduction. <br>Demons: Enemies within an area of effect become Silenced.<br>Monsters: Clears all the surrounding target's skill buffs, makes stacking impossible but the damage you take is increased. <br>Monsters: Decreases Damage of the enemies around by 90%, Damage taken increases by 100%. <br>Monsters: Targets in range get Blood Rage status. Damage increases by 100%. Stun when dealing damage to surrounding targets. <br>When Demons and Monsters die, deducts a stack of Demons and Monsters and inflicts Devil Fodder, which increases own Damage by 30%.
