desc_buf_adv034_fyc_ng_01_0=Fairy-Like Concentration Record<br>When you attack the target, there is a chance to apply Fairy-like buff to the target. With the buff, the target's evasion rate will increase by 80%, but every skill will recover the boss HP by 5%. The buff lasts for 10 seconds, and will not be activated again in 30 seconds.
