desc_buf_clone007_ssy_yxbr_0=Every time the Boss attacks the player, a level of Mercy is added to player. When there are more than 20 levels, target's hatred is cleared.
desc_buf_clone013_shewang_0=When killing the Gold Thread King Snake, some snake Blood was smeared on your hand. The nearby silver thread snakes smelled the scent and see you as one of their own. They no longer attack you.
desc_buf_clone013_shewang_1=When battling with the Gold Thread King Snake, some snake Blood was smeared on your hand. The nearby silver thread snakes smelled the scent and see you as one of their own. They no longer try to attack you.
desc_buf_clone019_Yxxl1_0=Infamy grows more acute together with Bellicosity
desc_buf_clone019_sxg_0=Attack increased and Defense decreased. Boss attacks will cause a Blood Drain effect
desc_buf_clone031_035_0=The status effect can stack up to 5 times. <br>When there are 5 stacks, if the Boss uses Sword Hell, there will be Bleeding effect. <br>The effect of Arrogance cannot be nullified.
desc_buf_clone033_gdj_029_0=When you kill your target, it will drop Whirlpool Chi Fragment.
desc_buf_clone033_gdj_030_0=When you kill your target, you'll gain Whirlpool skill effect.
desc_buf_clone033_gdj_048_0=Reduce rage of yourself and your allies within 4 meters by 20 per second. <br>If you fail to kill the enemy within 10 seconds, all players of your team will lose 4000 HP.<br>If you kill the enemy successfully within 10 seconds, a Bloodthirsty Space will appear at the spot which can increase the damage to all targets by 100%.
desc_buf_clone034_fs_wf_09_0=Destroy all flame traps.
desc_buf_clone034_hx_wf_03_0=Knocks all players flying after 5s. Gives BOSS Soultaking state for 5s.
