desc_buf_clone034_jx_06_0=<font color="#ffff00">Concentration</font><br>Currently in Concentration state. Must kill small puppets nearby to disturb will.
desc_buf_clone034_jx_06_range_0=<font color="#ffff00">Concentration</font><br> kill the micro-organs in the scope of the spirit of the people, can be disturbed life and death sentenced to disciples
desc_buf_clone034_ms_09_0=Controlled by Mu Shu. If killed, it will deal damage to Mu Shu.
desc_buf_clone034_qybgs_ng_01_0=Chance to get "Sword's Will" effect after each attack. Each stack increases damage done from skills. Not cleared after player is killed.
desc_buf_clone034_xuanjibao_lh07_0=The elite organ will launch the power of the spiked body will be close to its small organs to kill
