desc_buf_clone038_wdgr_09_0=The insect will explode in 20 seconds and deduct all the players' 50% of HP, while ignore any defense effect. The insect will be killed after being attacked for 10 times.
desc_buf_clone038_wdgr_09_1=The insect will explode in 20 seconds and deduct all the players' 50% of HP, while ignore any defense effect. The insect will be killed after being attacked for 10 times.
desc_buf_clone038_wdgr_wf03_0=Thousand Poison Incest Body<br>Be immune to 95% of damage when being attacked.<br>Cause 20% of HP loss to all targets within 5 meters every 2 seconds.<br>Release the insects in the body, if the insects are not killed within 3 seconds, they will enhance the Invaded by Insect Poison effect.
desc_buf_clone039_fxmy_11_0=Getting killed will remove the Demonic Snow Ape Wrath status. <br>When the status is over, all the targets within 10 meter range are killed instantly (including the Icicle).
desc_buf_clone040_cj_01_0=Enters Silent state after 3 seconds. Will be instantly killed by Cui Ji if you make any movements, use any skills, or use any flying skills in the next 5 seconds.
desc_buf_clone040_cj_03_0=Stay calm and focused. Be ready for anything.
desc_buf_clone040_duym_wf_02_0=Red Blood Snake<br> Each attack have a chance to cause target to lose 5% HP; <br>Debuffs target with “Red Blood Poison” upon landing a hit.<br> While alive, buffs One-eyed Python with one level of “Red Blood Poison Liquid”; <br>When target is killed, all players within 100 meters will lose 80% HP, and two red blood snakes will be summoned to its location.
desc_buf_clone040_duym_wf_05_0=Quiet<br> Enter the mist and wait to strike. <br>Damage increased by 30%, dodge rate increased by 100%.<br> Effect removed when all the mist snakes are killed.
desc_buf_clone040_duym_wf_07_01_0=Mist Snake<br> When killed, clear one level of Single-eyed Python's “Mist Snake - Conceal” effect.
desc_buf_clone040_jqw_16_0=Face of Meditation<br> The further away from BOSS, the more damage dealt.
desc_buf_clone040_jqw_17_0=Face of Meditation<br> The further away from BOSS, the more damage dealt.
desc_buf_clone040_jqw_18_0=Face of Meditation<br> The further away from BOSS, the more damage dealt.
desc_buf_clone040_sw_wf_02_0=Old puppet. The energy left behind after it's killed will form a HP recovery area.
desc_buf_clone040_sw_wf_04_0=Ignorant<br> Damage taken decreased by 50%, damage dealt increased by 50%. Summon a puppet nearby after 1 minute. If puppet is not destroyed within 1 minute, deadly damage will be dealt (ignore most skill buffs).
desc_buf_clone040_sw_wf_06_0=Remove "Ignorant" status' deadly effect on player after the puppet has been defeated.
desc_buf_clone040_sw_wfz_06_0=Receive a stack of "Astral - Extinguished" Every time a target is killed. When stacked 3 times, randomly and instantly kill a target. All stacks removed afterwards.
desc_buf_clone040_ty_01_0=Wuji<br> Damage increased by 20% every time a target is killed. Can be stacked 50 times. Effect removed after leaving battle.
desc_buf_clone040_ty_02_0=Wuji Strike<br> Damage increased by 20%. Each stack adds more damage.
desc_buf_clone041_qhqdz_04_0=Cherry Blossom Clone. <br>When the buff ends, all surrounding targets will be forced to have 1 remaining HP. <br>When attacked, the other clones within 100 meters will heal HP. <br>When killed, the other clones within 100 meters will be instantly killed.
desc_buf_clone041_qhqdz_04_1=Cherry Blossom Clone. <br>When the buff ends, all surrounding targets will be forced to have 1 remaining HP. <br>When attacked, the other clones within 100 meters will heal HP. <br>When killed, the other clones within 100 meters will be instantly killed.
desc_buf_clone043_jll_06_0=Cobweb Wrap<br>Stun.<br>Lose 20% HP every second and recover 0.1% HP for Jin Linglong every second.<br>When being killed, recovers 30% HP for Jin Linglong and increases Jin Linglong's movement speed by 5%.
desc_buf_clone043_wss_ng_01_0=All Empty Phase<br>When casting All Empty, summon demon shadow on the battlefield. Kill the Null Demon Shadow to get the move Test Medicine.
desc_buf_cs_clone_gdj_001_0=Mind-Eroding Poison reduces your HP by 2% per second and adds rage effect (increasing damage) on yourself.<br>The effect can be cleared by killing poison insects.
desc_buf_cs_clone_gdj_002_0=Improve rage effect and deal 300 damage to surrounding players once per second. <br>The effect can be cleared by killing poison insects.
desc_buf_csth_wy_005_0=Upon killing an enemy Morale boosts, HP is Recovered (during the Recovery buff triggered by a kill, player's Heal effect is recovered, HP Medicine can be used and so on. Lasts 5 seconds)
desc_buf_dmp_huitou_hz01_0=Repent to Dharma sincerely. Infamy decraese rate greatly accelerates, and have a chance to get "salvation" test. Complete it successfully to clear extra Infamy. (Can double click to stop repentance)
desc_buf_dmp_huitou_hz03_0=10 seconds after the crossing test will come, complete the test can be an additional reduction in the number of killings.
