desc_buf_dth_cf_001_0=Practicing martial arts carelessly, bloodthirst turns one into a demon. All Damage reduced by 60%, you need to kill somebody else Possessed by the Devil in order to disperse the state (attacking a player Possessed by the Devil has a 300 point External Damage bonus). The state will disappear when the player Possessed by the Devil at the same time with you dies.
