desc_buf_hsp_gdj_wcm_wf_001_0=Truth of Darkness<br>When boss's HP is below 70%, each of his attacks has a 50% chance of inflicting Dark Chill onto his targets. When Dark Chill is stacked 10 times, target is frozen in ice and paralyzed for 20 seconds. If other players do not break the ice within these 20 seconds, target will lose 80% HP.
