desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_1=<font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Friendship</font> State<br>Elusive Friendship: Target move <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> increased by 100%, when the target makes a move, if the move is not a Kunlun School qin-style martial arts, it will gain a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Liver and Intestine Break</font> state, <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> decreased by 10%, up to 3 layers, lasting for 10 seconds. When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 layers, it will additionally decrease the <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 100% and last until the next move within 10 seconds.<br>When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 layers or the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Elusive Friendship state will be removed for both parties.
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_1_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_1_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_1_1=Decreases Accuracy by 10%.
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_2_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_2_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_2_1=Accuracy decreased by 100%
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_1=Friendship is hard to find: When using a Kunlun School qin-style martial arts move, the target's internal energy consumption is reduced by 50%. If the target also uses a Kunlun School qin-style martial arts move, both the target and the user gain a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Harmony and Resonance</font> status. All Kunlun qin-style martial arts <font color="#f9fc00">damage is increased</font> by 10%, up to a maximum of 3 layers, lasting for 10 seconds. When the Harmony and Resonance status reaches 3 layers, it also prevents the next use of a Kunlun qin-style martial arts rage move from being affected by negative status effects for 10 seconds. When the Harmony and Resonance status reaches 3 layers or when the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Friendship is hard to find status is removed from both parties.
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_1_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_1_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_1_1=<font color="#FFAE00">Harmony and Resonance</font><br>All Kunlun qin-style martial arts <font color="#f9fc00">damage is increased</font> by 10%, up to a maximum of 3 layers, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_2_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_2_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_2_1=The next use of a Kunlun qin-style martial arts rage move is <font color="#f9fc00">immune to negative status effects</font>.
