desc_buf_CS_kl_syl07_01_1=Each level of climbing the tower reduces the <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> of techniques by 30%, decaying one level every 3 seconds. Each decay also gains an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font>.
