desc_buf_CS_kl_wltf05_0=When successfully blocking, accumulate a strand of <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> for 15 seconds, which can stack up to 5 layers. After successfully breaking through the defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Far-reaching Eyes]</font> or hitting a target without defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Swirling Eight Directions]</font>, the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> will erupt, with each layer increasing the power of the moves in this set by 10%. <br>After the eruption of <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font>, it will dissipate after 5 seconds. <br>It is not possible to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> again within 5 seconds after the eruption.
desc_buf_CS_kl_wltf05_1=May the cold wind carry me, reaching for the moon with my hand. When successfully blocking, accumulate a strand of <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> for 15 seconds, which can stack up to 5 layers. After successfully breaking through the defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Thousand Miles of Sight]</font> or hitting a target without defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Eight Directions of Swaying]</font>, the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> will erupt, increasing the power of the moves by 10% for each layer and adding additional damage with each hit. <br> The <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> will dissipate after the eruption for 10 seconds. <br> It is not possible to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> again within 15 seconds after the eruption. <br> Upgrading the moves will increase the additional damage.
desc_buf_CS_kl_wltf05_1_0=desc_buf_CS_kl_wltf05_1_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_wltf05_1_1=The <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> can stack up to 5 layers for 15 seconds.
