desc_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_0=desc_CS_kl_ymchj05_0
desc_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_1=Successfully blocking adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> for oneself: when being critically hit, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> is raised for oneself, and the target's attack will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Tracing</font> status to the target. Moon Immersion can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds. <br>The absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the move and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, all <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> statuses are cleared and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds. <br>Switching tactics clears the effects of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> and the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font>.
desc_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_10=Successfully blocking adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> for oneself: when being critically hit, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> is raised for oneself, and the target's attack will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Tracing</font> status to the target. Moon Immersion can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds. <br>The absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the move and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, all <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> statuses are cleared and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds. <br>Switching tactics clears the effects of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> and the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font>.
