desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_1=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 9 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_10=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 13.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_11=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 14 seconds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_12=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 15 seconds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>.
