desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_2=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, you can gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, lasting for 9.5 seconds, with a maximum of 3 stacks.<br>For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, when using the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>, you can additionally gain 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_3=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, you can gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, lasting for 10 seconds, with a maximum of 3 stacks.<br>For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, when using the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>, you can additionally gain 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_4=<font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font> status for 10.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using 【Floating Sky and Vast Sea】 and 【Autumn Night Dreaming】.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_5=<font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font> status for 11 seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Clouds in the Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using 【Floating Sky and Vast Sea】 and 【Autumn Night Dreaming】.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_6=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, you can gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, lasting for 11.5 seconds, with a maximum of 4 stacks.<br>For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, when using the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Floating Sky and Vast Sea</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Night Dreaming</font>, you can also gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font>.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_7=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 12 seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using 【Floating Sky and Vast Sea】 and 【Autumn Night Dreaming】.
desc_buf_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_8=<font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea Gazing</font>: When successfully blocking an enemy attack, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status for 12.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks. <br> For each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> status, gain an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> when using 【Floating Sky and Vast Sea】 and 【Autumn Night Dreaming】.
