desc_buf_ng_gb_101_1=<font color="#f9fc00">One Qi Haina Gong (Ideogram)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Shi Po Tian Jing</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to increase one's own defense reduction by 30% and all move damage by 10% for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Fen Yue Gui Yuan</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to cause additional yang damage to the target and reduce the cooldown time of Shi Po Tian Jing by 4 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Tian Yuan Po Wu</font>: When being attacked, there is a certain chance to remove some attack effects on the opponent, such as additional damage and defense reduction, which directly or indirectly enhance damage, and reduce their damage by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_0=Autumn Old Secret
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Qiu Lao Jue</font><br>When being attacked, there is a certain chance to create a qi shield around oneself (which can absorb a certain amount of damage).
