desc_buf_ng_kl_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Qiu Lao Jue</font><br>When being attacked, there is a certain chance to create a qi shield around oneself (which can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Old Age Formula</font><br>When attacked, there is a certain chance to create a spiritual shield around oneself (which can absorb a certain amount of damage). If attacked during the period of the spiritual shield, the enemy attacking oneself will suffer a negative effect: "Aging".<br><font color="#FF3030">Aging</font>: Reduces damage from all moves by 50%, decreasing by 5% per second, lasting for 10 seconds.
