desc_buf_ng_kl_001_cd_1=Autumn Old Age Secret Internal Cooldown
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_0=Proud Sun Secret
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun Formula</font><br>There is a certain chance with each attack to inject the target with a "Proud Sun True Qi".<br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the period of True Qi, the timer will be reset)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1_0=Proud Sun
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun True Qi</font><br>Continuously drains health.
