desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun True Qi</font><br>Continuously drains health.
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun True Qi</font><br>Continuously drains health and will spread to the surrounding area.
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun Formula</font><br>There is a certain chance with each attack to inject the target with a "Proud Sun True Qi".<br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the period of True Qi, the timer will be reset)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_2_0=Proud Sun Contagion
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_2_1=Proud Sun Contagion
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Proud Sun Formula</font><br>There is a certain chance with each attack to inject the target with a "Proud Sun True Qi".<br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the period of True Qi, the timer will be reset)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Pride Sun Formula</font><br>Each attack has a chance to inject a "Pride Sun Qi" into the target.<br><font color="#FF3030">Pride Sun Qi</font>: Continuously lose health. (If injected again during the Qi outbreak, the timer will be reset)<br>If there are hostile targets within a 4-meter radius of the target, the Qi will spread to the surrounding area and inject a "Pride Sun Qi" into the affected targets. (Affected targets cannot be affected again until the effect ends)
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_0=Light formula
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_1=<font color="#f9fc00">The Art of Conversation</font><br>Using internal strength to resist oneself, there is a chance to shock and injure enemies who attack, causing their lower body meridians to become disordered and suffer from the negative effect "limping".<br><font color="#FF3030">Limping</font>: The affected target will be shocked and injured every time they attack, causing a certain amount of Yin damage to themselves; and every time they move, their actions will become increasingly slow, but stopping movement can slowly alleviate the symptoms.<br><font color="#FF3030">Graceful Posture</font>: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 10 points of light skill value.
