desc_buf_ng_kl_004_5=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Qi</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Dissonant Melody</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after it takes effect, there will be a brief rest period).<br><font color="#FF3030">Melodious Harmony</font>: Each time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after it takes effect, there will be a brief rest period).<br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmonizing the Qin and Se</font>: Within 10 seconds after triggering one of the melodies, there is a slight increase in the chance of triggering the second melody and a significant reduction in its rest period. If the second melody is successfully triggered, its effect is enhanced by 100% (maximum of 10 times), and during the triggering period, one's damage from techniques is increased by 10% or defense is increased by 10% depending on the type of melody. The effect ends and enters a rest period.
