desc_buf_ng_kl_004_cd_1=Harmony of Qin and Se Cooldown
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_0=Wind Rising Secret
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Wind Rising Formula</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critically striking or being critically struck, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze" which reduces the damage taken from critical strikes by 5% for 15 seconds. Each subsequent critical strike or being critically struck increases the stack by 1, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase the duration and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases damage dealt and critical strike damage by 5%. Removing a stack by critically striking an enemy or after 10 seconds will cause the effect to end.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_0=Gentle Breeze Brushing Against the Face
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack reduces damage taken from critical strikes by 5%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack reduces damage taken from critical strikes by 6%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack reduces damage taken from critical strikes by 7%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack reduces damage taken from critical strikes by 8%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack reduces damage taken from critical strikes by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Wind Rising Formula</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critically striking or being critically struck, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze" which reduces the damage taken from critical strikes by 6% for 15 seconds. Each subsequent critical strike or being critically struck increases the stack by 1, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase the duration and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your damage and critical strike damage by 6%. Critical striking an enemy removes 1 stack, or the stacks disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_0=Be In High and Vigorous Spirits
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack increases damage and critical strike damage by 5%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack increases damage and critical strike damage by 6%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack increases damage and critical strike damage by 7%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack increases damage and critical strike damage by 8%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Gentle Breeze</font><br>Each stack increases damage and critical strike damage by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Wind Rising Formula</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critically striking or being critically struck, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 7% for 15 seconds. Each critical strike or being critically struck during this time increases the stack by 1, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase the duration, and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your own attack damage and critical strike damage by 7%. Critical striking an enemy removes 1 stack, or the stacks disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Wind Rising Formula</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critically striking or being critically struck, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 8% for 15 seconds. Each critical strike or being critically struck during this time increases the stack by 1, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase the duration, and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain the corresponding number of stacks based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your own attack damage and critical strike damage by 8%. Critical striking an enemy removes 1 stack, or the stacks disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Wind Rising Rule</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critically striking or being critically struck, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 10% for 15 seconds. Each time you critically strike or are critically struck, gain 1 stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Vitality</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your damage and critical strike damage by 10%. Critically striking an enemy removes 1 stack, or they will disappear after 10 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Immortal Spirit</font>: If "Vitality" ends normally, each stack that was not consumed can reduce the cooldown of "Gentle Breeze" by 5 seconds.
