desc_buf_ng_kl_006_0=Kunlun Induction
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Pull</font><br>There is a chance to infuse internal energy into the target when attacking without being blocked, planting the "Kunlun's Strength". A Kunlun's Pull line is formed between the two sides, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering)<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Strength</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 30% per second; there is a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun's Strength" by 1 second while causing damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Pull·Transforming Strength into Qi</font>: While the line is active, it can continuously restore one's own health and energy.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_0=Kunlun strength
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Strength</font><br>Continuously causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 30%, with a chance to extend the duration of damage by 1 second.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Strength</font><br>Continuously causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 35%, with a chance to extend the duration of damage by 1 second.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Strength</font><br>Continuously causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 40%, with a chance to extend the duration of damage by 1 second.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Strength</font><br>Continuously causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 45%, with a chance to extend the duration of damage by 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Strength</font><br>Continuously causes Yin damage and slows down the target by 50%, with a chance to extend the duration of damage by 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Pull</font><br>There is a chance to infuse internal energy into the target when attacking an unguarded target, planting the "Kunlun's Strength". A Kunlun's Pull line is formed between the two sides, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Strength</font>: Causes Yin damage and reduces movement speed by 35% per second; there is a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun's Strength" by 1 second while causing damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Pull·Transforming Strength into Qi</font>: While the line is active, it can continuously restore one's own health and energy.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_2_0=Paralyzed
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_2_1=Paralyzed
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Pull</font><br>There is a chance to infuse internal energy into the target when attacking an unguarded target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. A Kunlun's Pull line is formed between the two, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows the target by 40% per second; there is a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 1 second while causing damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Pull·Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the line is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun's Pull·Caught in a Dilemma</font>: When the distance between the two is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun's Pull line becomes ineffective and the target suffers a one-time damage.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_3_0=Stiffness
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_3_1=
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Pull</font><br>There is a chance to infuse internal energy into the target when attacking an unguarded target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. A Kunlun's Pull line is formed between the two, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows the target by 45% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 2 seconds when dealing damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Pull: Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the line is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun's Pull: Caught Between Advance and Retreat</font>: When the distance between the two is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun's Pull line becomes ineffective and the target takes a one-time damage; when the distance is less than 4 meters, the target is immobilized.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Kunlun's Pull</font><br>There is a chance to infuse internal energy into the target when attacking an unguarded target, planting "Kunlun's Strength". A Kunlun's Pull line is formed between the two sides, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering)<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Strength</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows down by 50% per second; at the same time, there is a chance to extend "Kunlun's Strength" by 2 seconds when causing damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun's Pull·Transforming Strength into Qi</font>: When the line is active, it can continuously restore one's own health and energy.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun's Pull·Caught in a Dilemma</font>: When the distance between the two sides is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun's Pull line becomes invalid, causing a one-time damage to the target and stiffening for 3 seconds; when the distance between the two sides is less than 4 meters, it will immobilize the target.
