desc_buf_ng_mj_101_1=<font color="#f9fc00">The Secret of Moving Heaven and Burning Sea (Intention)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Overturning the Hand and Burning the Sea</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to add 299 points of (additional 30% damage when on the ground) yang damage within 9 seconds (cooldown time of 20 seconds, maximum of 8 additional damage);<br><font color="#9932CD">Turning the Hand and Moving Heaven</font>: When hit, there is a certain chance to absorb 15% of maximum health damage within 5 seconds (cooldown time of 25 seconds);<br><font color="#CFB53B">Moving Heaven and Burning Sea</font>: If "Overturning the Hand and Burning the Sea" is triggered and "Turning the Hand and Moving Heaven" has been triggered within 25 seconds, then the damage of all moves will increase by 15% and all defense reduction will be ignored by 15% within 9 seconds. If "Turning the Hand and Moving Heaven" is triggered and "Overturning the Hand and Burning the Sea" has been triggered within 20 seconds, then all defense will increase by 50% within 10 seconds (decreases by 10% every 2 seconds, does not decrease when on the ground).
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_001_0=Autumn Old Secret
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Old Secret</font><br>There is a certain chance to create a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Autumn Old Secret</font><br>There is a certain chance to create a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Autumn's Secret</font><br>When attacked, there is a chance to create a spiritual shield around oneself (which can absorb a certain amount of damage). If attacked while the spiritual shield is active, the attacking player will receive a negative effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Aging</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Aging</font>: Reduces damage from all moves by 50%, decreasing by 5% every second.
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Autumn's Secret</font><br>When attacked, there is a chance to create a spiritual shield around oneself (which can absorb a certain amount of damage). If attacked while the spiritual shield is active, the attacking player will receive a negative effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Aging</font><br><font color="#f9fc00">Aging</font>: Reduces damage from all moves by 50%, decreasing by 5% every second.
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_002_0=Proud Sun Secret
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_002_1=Sunshine: Every time a move is used, there is a 20% chance to inject the target with Sunshine Qi, causing them to continuously take damage (the higher the internal energy, the stronger the effect), lasting for 12 seconds. (If injected again during the Sunshine Qi's effect, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_002_2=Sunshine: Every time a move is used, there is a 20% chance to inject the target with Sunshine Qi, causing them to continuously take damage (the higher the internal energy, the stronger the effect), lasting for 12 seconds. (If injected again during the Sunshine Qi's effect, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_002_3=Sunshine: Every time a move is used, there is a 20% chance to inject the target with Sunshine Qi, causing them to continuously take damage (the higher the internal energy, the stronger the effect), lasting for 12 seconds. (If injected again during the Sunshine Qi's effect, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_002_4=Sunshine: Each time this move is used, there is a 20% chance to inject the target with Sunshine Qi, causing them to continuously take damage (the higher the internal strength, the stronger the effect), lasting for 12 seconds. (If injected again during the Sunshine Qi's active period, the timer will be reset). If there are hostile targets within 8 meters of the target, the Qi will spread to the surrounding area, injecting the affected targets with Sunshine Qi as well. (Affected targets cannot be affected again until the effect ends).
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_003_0=Light formula
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_003_1=Unsteady Steps: There is a chance that each attack will cause the target's lower meridians to become disordered. Affected targets will be shaken and lose qi and blood with each move, and their movement speed will decrease by 2% each time they move. If they stop moving for 1 second, their movement speed will recover by 2%. <br>Graceful Posture: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 15 points of light skill value.
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_003_2=Unsteady Steps: There is a chance that each attack will cause the target's lower meridians to become disordered. Affected targets will be shaken and lose qi and blood with each move, and their movement speed will decrease by 2% each time they move. If they stop moving for 1 second, their movement speed will recover by 2%. <br>Graceful Posture: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 15 points of light skill value.
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_003_3=Unsteady Steps: There is a chance that each attack will cause the target's lower meridians to become disordered. Affected targets will be shaken and lose qi and blood with each move, and their movement speed will decrease by 2% each time they move. If they stop moving for 1 second, their movement speed will recover by 2%. <br>Graceful Posture: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 15 points of light skill value.
desc_buf_ng_npc_kl_003_4=Unsteady Steps: There is a chance that each attack will cause the target's lower meridians to become disordered. Affected targets will be shaken and lose qi and blood with each move, and their movement speed will decrease by 2% each time they move. If they stop moving for 1 second, their movement speed will recover by 2%. <br>Graceful Posture: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 15 points of light skill value.
