desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_01_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Walk</font><br>Increases self movement speed by 12%. If attacked again while in "Cloud Walk" state, restores 48 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_01_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Walk</font><br>Increases self movement speed by 15%. If attacked again while in "Cloud Walk" state, restores 65 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_01_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Walk</font><br>Increases self movement speed by 20%. If attacked again while in "Cloud Walk" state, restores 82 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_01_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Travel</font><br>Increases own movement speed by 24%. When attacked again while in "Cloud Travel" state, restores 100 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_01_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Travel</font><br>Increases own movement speed by 30%. When attacked again while in "Cloud Travel" state, restores 119 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_02_0=desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_02_0
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_02_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Dragon's Fury</font><br>Increases own attack damage by 17%.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_02_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Dragon's Fury</font><br>Increases own attack damage by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Steps</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Walk</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Walk" status for 5 seconds: increases movement speed by 12%, and if attacked again while under the "Cloud Walk" status, restores 48 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Jade Steps</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Walk</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Walk" status for 6 seconds: increases movement speed by 15%, and if attacked again while under the "Cloud Walk" status, restores 65 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_3=<font color="#f9fc00">The Jade Traveler's Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Travel</font>: Has a chance to gain the "Cloud Travel" status for 7 seconds when attacked: Increases own movement speed by 20%. If attacked again while under the "Cloud Travel" status, restores 82 (affected by internal and melee power) health points up to 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Azure Travel Formula</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Travel</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Travel" status for 8 seconds: increases movement speed by 24%, and if attacked again during this status, restores 100 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).<br><font color="#9932CD">Dragon's Surprise</font>: If the "Cloud Travel" status is active or ends within 10 seconds, launching another attack will grant the "Dragon's Surprise" status for 8 seconds: increases damage of own moves by 17%. (Can only be triggered once after each "Cloud Travel" status.)
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Azure Travel Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Cloud Travel</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Travel" status for 10 seconds: increases movement speed by 30%, and if attacked again while under the "Cloud Travel" status, restores 119 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times). <br><font color="#9932CD">Dragon's Surprise</font>: If the "Cloud Travel" status is active or ends, launching another attack within 10 seconds will grant the "Dragon's Surprise" status for 10 seconds: increases damage of own moves by 20%. (Can only be triggered once after the "Cloud Travel" status is activated)
