desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Traveling Technique</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" status, restoring 1% of health per second for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" status, increasing the damage of moves by 10% for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_2=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Traveling Technique</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" status, restoring 1% of health per second for 6 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" status, increasing the damage of moves by 12% for 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_3=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Travel Technique</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew Nourishment" state, which restores 1% of health every second for 7 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost Intensity" state, which increases the damage of moves by 14% for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_4=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Travel Technique</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew Nourishment" state, which restores 1% of health every second for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost Intensity" state, which increases the damage of moves by 16% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_5=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Travel Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" state, restoring 1.5% of health per second for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" state, increasing damage dealt by 20% for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew Nourishment" and "Autumn Frost Intensity" are active, being attacked will add "Spring Dew Nourishment·Enemy" to the enemy, reducing damage dealt by 20% (up to 10 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew Nourishment" or "Autumn Frost Intensity" expires), and "Autumn Frost Intensity" will also heal an additional 10% of damage dealt.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_6=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Travel Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" state, restoring 1.5% of health per second for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" state, increasing damage by 24% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew Nourishment" and "Autumn Frost Intensity" are active, being attacked will add "Spring Dew Nourishment·Enemy" to the enemy: reduces damage by 24% (up to 12 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew Nourishment" or "Autumn Frost Intensity" on self disappears), "Autumn Frost Intensity" also gains 12% additional life steal when attacking.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_7=<font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Traveler's Secret</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" status, restoring 1.5% of health per second for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" status, increasing damage dealt by 30% for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew and Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew Nourishment" and "Autumn Frost Intensity" are active, being attacked will add the "Spring Dew Nourishment - Enemy" status to the enemy, reducing damage dealt by 30% (up to 15 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew Nourishment" or "Autumn Frost Intensity" on self expires), and "Autumn Frost Intensity" will also heal an additional 15% of damage dealt.
desc_buf_ng_wd_101_0=<font color="#f9fc00">Tai Chi Divine Skill (Intention)</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Gas Transformation</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to transform energy and absorb 30% of the damage, and restore a certain amount of health.<br><font color="#9932CD">Energy Traction</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to pull and remove 30% of the damage, and cause a certain amount of soft damage to the opponent.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Tai Chi is the Way</font>: When "Gas Transformation" and "Energy Traction" are triggered, all damage from self techniques is increased by 10%, up to a maximum of 5 layers, removed after attacking, lasting for 10 seconds.
