desc_buf_sc_month_03_0=Four Seasons Rotation · Autumn<br>Each attack has a certain chance to add the "Cool Autumn" state to oneself.<br>When the state is triggered, each attack will cause 20% loss of health to all friendly targets within 8 meters (ignoring defense reduction effects), and if the health of the friendly target is below 30%, it will stun the target for 5 seconds.
