desc_buf_sc_month_04_0=Seasonal Rotation: Winter<br>When under attack, there is a certain probability of adding 20 layers of the "Winter" state to oneself.<br>When the state is triggered, moving and using light skills will remove layers, with each layer removed resulting in a 1% loss of health.<br>When the state ends normally, it will cause oneself to enter the "Deep Freeze" state, during which one will be unconscious and receive double the damage.<br>(When in the "Winter" or "Deep Freeze" state, the "Winter" state will not be triggered.)
desc_buf_sc_month_04_01_0=Winter<br>Gradually freezes the entire body, and continuously moving and using light skills will remove layers,<br>with each layer removed resulting in a 1% loss of health.<br>When the state ends normally, it will enter the "Deep Freeze" state.
