desc_buf_ythc_tf_001_16=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Straight Up<br>Arm Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving a fatal injury, 30% of health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)
