desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_0=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Up with the Support of the Wind<br>Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving a fatal injury, all health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)<br>Damage is increased by 10%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_1=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Up with the Support of the Wind<br>Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving a fatal injury, all health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)<br>Damage is increased by 10%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_10=Soaring Upward<br>Rising to the top with the help of strength, internal energy, body movement, physical strength, and qi, all of which are increased by 50%. <br> External and internal defense are both increased by 50%. <br> Movement speed is increased by 30%. <br> When receiving a fatal injury, all health is restored. (This effect is removed after activation) <br> Damage is increased by 30%. <br> When receiving damage, there is an 80% chance of triggering the "domineering" state, which includes a domineering body and ignores all damage. (Cooldown time of 1 minute)
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_2=Soaring Upward<br>Rising to the top with the help of strength, internal energy, body movement, physical strength, and qi, all of which are increased by 50%. <br> External and internal defense are both increased by 50%. <br> Movement speed is increased by 30%. <br> When receiving a fatal injury, all health is restored. (This effect is removed after activation) <br> Damage is increased by 15%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_3=Soaring Upward<br>Raise your arms, internal energy, body movement, physical strength, and qi by 50%. <br> Increase external and internal defense by 50%. <br> Increase movement speed by 30%. <br> When receiving fatal damage, restore all health. (Effect will be removed after activation) <br> Increase damage by 20%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_4=Soaring Upward<br>Raise your arms, internal energy, body movement, physical strength, and qi by 50%. <br> Increase external and internal defense by 50%. <br> Increase movement speed by 30%. <br> When receiving fatal damage, restore all health. (Effect will be removed after activation) <br> Increase damage by 25%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_5=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Straight Up<br>Arm Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External Defense and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving fatal damage, all health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)<br>Damage is increased by 30%.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_6=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Straight Up<br>Arm Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External Defense and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving a fatal injury, all health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)<br>Damage is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving damage, there is a 30% chance to trigger the "Dominance" state, which grants invincibility and ignores all damage for 1 minute.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_002_7=Soaring Upward<br>Rising Straight Up<br>Arm Strength, Internal Energy, Body Movement, Physical Fitness, and Qi are increased by 50%.<br>External Defense and Internal Defense are increased by 50%.<br>Movement speed is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving fatal damage, all health is restored. (Effect is removed after activation)<br>Damage is increased by 30%.<br>When receiving damage, there is a 40% chance to trigger "Dominance" state, which grants invincibility and ignores all damage. (Cooldown time: 1 minute)
