desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_2=Gain 50% more talent points<br>Increase healing effect and recovery amount by 100% when picking up medicine in the imperial city at night<br>Reduce the time it takes to collect items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease the detection range of enemy targets by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 40% chance of dropping an extra treasure
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_3=Increase talent point acquisition by 50%<br>Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine during night exploration in the imperial city<br>Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease enemy target detection range by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 60% chance of obtaining an additional treasure
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_4=Increase talent point acquisition by 50%<br>Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine during night exploration in the imperial city<br>Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease enemy target detection range by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is an 80% chance of obtaining an additional treasure
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_5=Increase talent point acquisition by 50% <br> Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine during night exploration in the imperial city <br> Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds <br> Decrease enemy target detection range by 30% <br> When defeating a boss, there is a 100% chance of dropping an additional treasure.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_6=Increase talent point acquisition by 50%<br>Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine in the imperial city at night<br>Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease enemy detection range by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 100% chance of dropping an extra treasure<br>In non-combat state, automatically enter the "Wind Control" state, with increased movement speed, enhanced lightness skill, and an additional 10 points of lightness skill recovery.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_7=Increase talent point acquisition by 50%<br>Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine in the imperial city at night<br>Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease enemy target detection range by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 100% chance of obtaining an additional treasure<br>In non-combat situations, automatically enter the "Wind Control" state, with increased movement speed, enhanced lightness skill, and an additional 12 points of lightness skill recovery rate.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_8=Increase talent point acquisition by 50%<br>Increase healing effect recovery by 100% when picking up medicine in the imperial city at night<br>Reduce time spent collecting items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease enemy target detection range by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 100% chance of obtaining an additional treasure<br>In non-combat situations, automatically enter the "Wind Control" state, with increased movement speed, enhanced lightness skill, and an additional 15 points of lightness skill recovery rate.
desc_buf_ythc_tf_008_9=Gain 50% increase in talent points<br>When exploring the imperial city at night, the healing effect of picking up medicine is increased by 100%<br>Reduce the time it takes to collect items by 10 seconds<br>Decrease the detection range of enemy targets by 30%<br>When defeating a boss, there is a 100% chance of dropping an extra treasure<br>In non-combat state, automatically enter the state of controlling the wind, increasing movement speed, strengthening lightness skills, and an additional 17 points in lightness skill recovery rate
