desc_wuji_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_1_2=When being critically hit, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> is raised for oneself, and the target's attack will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Tracing</font> status to the target. Moon Immersion can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds.
