desc_wuji_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_1_9=When being critically hit, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> is raised for oneself, and the target's attack will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Tracing</font> status to the target. Moon Immersion can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_wuji_buf_CS_kl_ymchj05_2=Successfully blocking adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> for oneself: when being critically hit, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> is raised for oneself, and the target's attack will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Tracing</font> status to the target. Moon Immersion can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds.<br>The absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the technique and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> status will not be cleared and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds.<br>Switching tactics will clear the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Immersion</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> effects.
