desc_buf_jhzb_zd_khbd_0=<font color="#EE7600">Sunflower Manual</font><br>You went to learn from the Eunuch in the methods to train in Sunflower Manual. Defeat a monster before midnight or players above Peak of Power have a chance to receive Jianghu Treasures training points. Jianghu Treasures can also be used to train in Sunflower Manual<br>You are surrounded by a deadly aura. Any player can attack you.<br>Every time you cultivate successfully in Jinling (2154,2000), Suzhou (1044,1044) and Yanjing (1696,1308) between 8:00-9:00 p.m, your cultivation speed will be increased by 2 times and Jianghu VIPs nearby will get tons of Chi. (It's not included in the daily Chi limit)
desc_buf_jhzb_zd_xxdf_0=<font color="#EE7600">Star Vortex</font><br>You went to learn from the Five Terrors of the Labyrinth in the methods to train in Star Vortex. Defeat a monster before midnight or players above Superlative have a chance to receive Jianghu Treasures training points. Jianghu Treasures can also be used to train in Star Vortex<br>You are surrounded by a deadly aura. Any player can attack you.<br>Every time you cultivate successfully in Jinling (2154,2000), Suzhou (1044,1044) and Yanjing (1696,1308) between 8:00-9:00 p.m, your cultivation speed will be increased by 2 times and Jianghu VIPs nearby will get tons of Chi. (It's not included in the daily Chi limit)
