desc_buff_itm_add1_10=Increases your Brawn by 37 and External Attack Accuracy by 5% plus an External Attack Accuracy bonus of 26, for a duration of 3 days. Cannot be used together with other effects. Participating in the Mount Hua Competition will nullify the effect of Wuxing Pills
desc_buff_itm_add2_10=Increases your Dexterity by 37 and Maximum HP by 200, for a duration of 3 days. Cannot be used together with other effects. Participating in the Mount Hua Competition will nullify the effect of Wuxing Pills
desc_buff_itm_add3_10=Increases your Breath by 37 and Internal Skill Conversion by 5% plus an Internal Defense bonus of 32, for a duration of 3 days. Cannot be used together with other effects. Participating in the Mount Hua Competition will nullify the effect of Wuxing Pills
desc_buff_itm_add4_10=Increases your Spirit by 37 plus an Internal Attack Damage bonus of 26, for a duration of 3 days. Cannot be used together with other effects. Participating in the Mount Hua Competition will nullify the effect of Wuxing Pills
desc_buff_itm_add5_10=Increases your Stamina by 37 and Parry Limit by  600, for a duration of 3 days. Cannot be used together with other effects. Participating in the Mount Hua Competition will nullify the effect of Wuxing Pills
